<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - (-8)?</para>
  <para style="rem">Copyright information: Matthew (Mateu) in the Mashi language of the Western Province of Zambia; Copyright © 2022 by The Seed Company. All rights reserved.</para>
  <para style="h">MATEU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evangeli thza Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Evangeli thza</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mateu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Dihumo dya Yesu Krisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ou po odiyo mundandwe o mathzina o dihumo dya Yesu Krisitu ku tunderera kwa Davida, o mu mukuta wa Aburahama.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Aburahama yo tata wa Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Isaka yo tata wa Jakovo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Jakovo yo tata wa Juda nakurwenthzi naminenthzi,<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Juda yo tata wa Paresi na Zera, mama wo po Tamare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Paresi yo tata wa Hesiromi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Hesiromi yo tata wa Rama,<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Rama yo tata wa Aminadabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadabi yo tata wa Nashoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Nashoni yo tata wa Salimoni,<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni yo tata wa Boazi, mama wenthzi po nedi Rahaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Boazi yo tata wa Obedi, mama wenthzi po nedi Ruti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Obedi yo tata wa Jese,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Jese yo tata wa Fumu Davida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Davida yo tata wa Solomoni, mama wenthzi po nedi munu wa Uria,<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni yo tata wa Rehoboami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehoboami yo tata wa Abiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abiya yo tata wa Asa,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa yo tata wa Jehoshafati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Jehoshafati yo tata wa Jorami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Jorami yo tata wa Uziya,<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uziya yo tata wa Jotami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Jotami yo tata wa Ahazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahazi yo tata wa Hezekia,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia yo tata wa Manase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase yo tata wa Amoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amoni yo tata wa Josaya,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Josaya yo tata wa Jekonia naminenthzi mu thsikati ethsi a twariwire kupika ku Babilona.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Munyima thzo ku twariwa kupika ku Babilona:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:12">Jekonia wa kerekire Salatiele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:12">Salatiele yo tata wa Zerubabele,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabele yo tata wa Abiudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abiudi yo tata wa Eliakimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliakimi yo tata wa Azori,<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azori yo tata wa Sadoki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadoki yo tata wa Akimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akimi yo tata wa Eliudi,<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi yo tata wa Eliazare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Eliazare yo tata wa Matani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Matani yo tata wa Jakovo,<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Jakovo yo tata wa Josefa munu wa Madiya, mama wa Yesu oyu nethsiwa ci Mesiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Mweyo, kwekarire mikuta thzo dikumi na thzine ku tunda kwa Aburahama ku na kuma kwa Davida, thzo dikumi na thzine karo ku tunda kwa Davida shime ku na kuma apa a twariwerire kupika ku Babilona, no mikuta thzo dikumi na thzine ku tunda apa a twariwerire kupika shime ku na kuma pa kwerekiwa kwa Mesiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwerekiwa kwa Yesu Krisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Kwerekiwa kwa Yesu Krisitu kwekarire kenge: Mama wenthzi Madiya shime a ungekeriwire kwa mukwerume o dithzina dyo Josefa. Uno honi o kwa shime ku ciyeka, kwa wanaharire ci Madiya wekarire poremu kokoro o Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Mweyo, pakuninga ci munuwenthzi Josefa nedi munu o muwawa, ka a fotire ku mu fithsa honyi kwanu, wa anekerire ku mu rukurura ko kukana ku i dimuka anu.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Unone o ku anekera eyo, kangeru ka Fumu ka hokokire ku kwenthzi ku turo no ku mu ambera ci: “Josefa mwana Davida, wa yapa ku shimba Madiya ci ekare munuwoe, inene eyi a na remenena po yaa tunda ku Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Kenge a kwereka mukwerumeana, wangu wa ku mute dithzina dyo Yesu, inene kenge a ku yoyithsa anuenthzi kwivi yo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Eyi yoihe shime ya tendaharire ci i citombore neyi a ambire Fumu ka mukwakukethza ci: <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Diungu kenge mba a thza poremu no kwereka mwana o mukwerumeana, kenge mba mwithsa ci ‘Imanuele,’ ku amba ci ‘Nyambi netu a di.’”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Josefa ou a pindukire, wa tendire eyi ka mu raererire kangeru ka Fumu. Wa shimbire Madiya kwikara munuwenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Uno honi ka a rarire nenthzi shime ku ka kuma pa kwerekiwa kwa mwanenthzi. Josefa wa mu tire dithzina dyo Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Owanyanyami o ku muvo aa na mona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu shime erekiwerire mu mbongi ethzi thzi nethsiwa Betelehema, mu ditunga dya Judea, Heroda o ku di fumu. Mwethso thsikati akwerume owanyanyami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diywi dyo Thsigerike po dyaa amba yo mapurisita o Maperesia awa cirongithsire yo matungwethzi.</char></note> o ku muvo a keyire mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Epurire ci: “Kupi a di oyu kambu nerekiwa, oyu wa kwikara Fumu o Majuda? Tu na mono ditungwethzi dyenthzi o ku di va ku muvo, ngouno tu na di shupwera ku na mu pa direma.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Fumu Heroda ou a i yuvire wa karuperire nene, mofoci kengeyo nanu wahe o mu Yerusalema. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Wa wanekire akuru o mapurisita wahe narongithsi o murao no kwipura ci: “Oyu Mesiya ne kupi a na roera kwerekiwera?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />A mu tawire ci: “Mu Betelehema mbongi thzo mu ditunga dya Judea. Inene eyi a ñorire mukwakukethza po eyi:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“ ‘Owe Betelehema o mu ditunga dya Juda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">kadi cingwa o muonye ku mambongi oakuru o mu Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">inene ku koe kenge mba ku tunda muendithsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">oyu wa ku dithsa anuange Maisiraele.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Heroda ngou ethserire ku mukunda awo akwerume owanyanyami no ku wepwerikethza thsikati shemwa ethsi dya monaharire edyo ditungwethzi. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Mu thze ku Betelehema mu ka fotithsithse nawa yoyo mwanuke. Ou mwa ku ka mu wana mwa ku na ni tongwere, ci nga name na ku thze na ku ka mu pe direma.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ou a manine ku yuva eyi a ambire fumu, awo akwerume owanyanyami a shumunine ku thza. O kwa di mu dikuñwa, ditungwethzi edi a monine ku muvo dya wa tangererire ku Betelehema no ku kemana peuru thzo ndau apa ekarire mwanuke. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />A nyanyukire nene shemwa ou a monine edyo ditungwethzi. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Engenine mu nthzio no ku mona mwanuke na mama wenthzi Madiya. A tongamine ku manwi ku mu remeka, a kwatire mwinyungero yo no ku shimbamo ekunda yo gauda, insense no mira eyi a mu shimberire. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Pakuninga ci Nyambi wa wa nomenithsire ku turo ci a ku huka kwa Heroda, a hukire ku ditunga dyo ko dikuñwa dyadyo.<figure style="fig" alt="The Magi worship Jesus" file="cn01632c.tif" size="col" loc="Mat 2:7-12" copy="Cook" ref="2.7-12">Owanyanyami o ku muvo aa rombera Yesu</figure><verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa mu cirithsera ku Egepita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Akwerume owanyanyami o ku muvo ou a thzire, kangeru ka Fumu ka hokokire kwa Josefa ku turo. Ka mu amberire ci: “O pinduke o shimbe mwanuke na mama wenthzi o cirere ku Egepita. Wa ku kekareko shime ou na ku ku tongwera karo ci o huke, inene Heroda kenge a ku fotafota oyu mwanuke ci a mwipae.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Oo othsiku Josefa wa pindukire no ku shimba mwanuke na mama wenthzi ku thza ku Egepita. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />A kekarireko shime Heroda ou a fire. Eyi ya tendaharire ci i citombore neyi a ambire Fumu ka mukwakukethza yo kuninga ci: “Na nithsa mwanange ku tunda mu Egepita.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Heroda ou a monine ci a mwangerire awo akwerume owanyanyami, wa anthzipire nene. Wa tumine mashwarare ku Betelehema no muya mu ditunga momuhe ku kepaa anuke wahe wakwerume o myaka thzidi no ku huthsa pashi, ku endererithsa thsikati thsiya a yuvire kwakwerume owanyanyami ethsi dya monaharire ditungwethzi. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Mweyo, eyi a tendire Heroda ya citomborire neyi a ambire mukwakukethza Jeremia ci:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Mainga aa yuvahara mu mbongi thza Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">o makuano no mathsiwa oshokuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahele aa direra anenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">karo aa kana ku hengawethziwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">inene anenthzi a na fu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nashemienthzi aa huka ku Nazareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Heroda ou a fire, kangeru ka Fumu ka hokokire kwa Josefa ku turo mu Egepita. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Ka mu amberire ci: “O pinduke, o shimbe mwanuke na mama wenthzi o huke ku ditunga dya Isiraele, inene waya a fotire ci epae mwanuke na fu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Josefa ngou a pindukire no ku shimba mwanuke na mama wenthzi, no ku huka ku ditunga dya Isiraele. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Unone Josefa ou a yuvire ci Akelausi yodiyo na a shwana tata wenthzi Heroda kwikara fumu mu Judea, wa yapire ku thzako. Unone ou a mu nomenithsire Nyambi ku turo, wa thzire mu thsikiriti thsa Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Wa ka tungire mu mbongi ethzi thzi nethsiwa Nazareta. Eyi shime ya citomborire neyi a ambire akwakukethza ci: “Kenge a kwithsiwa ci MukwaNazareta.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa ya Johani Mukwakukorovethza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joh 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mwao mayuwa, Johani Mukwakukorovethza wa monaharire no ku tateka ku honga mu dikunguthsitu dya Judea. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Wa ambire ci: “Mu cere evi yenu, inene Kutumina ko ku Wiru pepi ku di.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Johani po yodiyo oyu a ambire yenthzi mukwakukethza Isaya ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Diywi dyoyu kuerera mu dikunguthsitu dyaa amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mu roithse mukwakwa wa Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">mu orore makuñwa enthzi!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Evata ya Johani shime ya kwamiwire pohunga o kamere, shime a ciangire mwiya o thsitumba mu mbunda, edya yenthzi nedi thsetuthsetu noki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Kethsiya thsikati anu o mu Yerusalema no Judea yomuhe, nanu awa ekarire mu mandau aa a na cihata no Rware rwa Jorodani, wahe a thzire ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Ou a citawerire evi yo, wa wa korovethzire mu Rware rwa Jorodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Unone Johani ou a monine Afarithsi nAsaduki owangi o kwa keya oku a korovethzerire, wa wa amberire ci: “Amwe mwana mayoka, edye naa mi nomenithsa ku cira kuanthzi wa Nyambi ou u keya? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Mweyo, mu kwame ekwama eyi i na monithsa kucera evi yenu. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Mwa anekera mu micima thzenu ku amba ci: ‘Tu di no tata wetu Aburahama.’ Inene naa mi tongwera ci Nyambi aa twethsa ku kwamena Aburahama ana poa mawe aa! <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Kamo ka na pakiwa kare pa mithzithzi thzetondo. Thsitondo no thsitondo thso kukana kwima ima yoiwa thsa ku henduriwe no ku kuheriwa mu mudiro.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />“Ame naa mi korovethza ko meyu, ku monithsa ci mu na cera evi yenu. Uno honi oyu keya munyima thzange po mukoro kupita ame, ka ni roerire shaanga ku mu shimbera mashangu enthzi. Kenge a ku na mi korovethza ko Mupepo Oukenu no mudiro. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Thsihere thsenthzi mu moko enthzi thsi di ku yererekethza vuroto. Kenge a ku kundura oheke pa thsihoto thsenthzi no ku u paka mu thsishepa, uno honi muyungu ao kenge a ku u tumeka ko mudiro u shithzimana.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Korovethzo thza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Kethsiya thsikati, Yesu wa tundire ku Galilea no ku thza ku Rware rwa Jorodani ci a ka mu korovethze Johani. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Unone Johani wa fotire kukana, wa ambire ci: “Owe po yowe o na roera ku ni korovethza, owe karo waa keya ku kwange?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Unone Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “O tawe ci ikare kengeyo thsino thsikati, inene yaa roera ci tu kwame eyi ci owawa u citombore.” Johani ngou a tawire.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yesu ou a korovethziwire, o ku womboka mu meyu popo diwiru dya yanthzurukire, wa monine Mupepo wa Nyambi o ku u shurumuka eci dikuci no ku keya ku na tura pa penthzi. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Ngou kwa tundire diywi ku wiru edi dya ambire ci: “Oyu po Mwanange, oyu na shima no ku ni roerithsa nene.”<figure style="fig" alt="John Baptizes Jesus" file="wa03810b.tif" size="col" loc="Mat 3:13-17" copy="Wade" ref="3.13-17">Johani aa korovethza Yesu</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="rem">LK, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa mu tumaura Satana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Mupepo Oukenu ngou wa twarire Yesu mu dikunguthsitu ku ka mu tumaura shamaonga. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Yesu ou a manine ku cikanga no nthzara mayuwa o makumi ane no mathsiku o makumi ane wa fire nthzara. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Aye mukwakutumaura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satana.</char></note> wa keyire ku kwenthzi no ku na mu ambera ci: “Ngeci yowe o Mwana Nyambi, o tumine aa mawe a piruke makende!”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ku na ñoriwa ci: ‘Munu tumba a yoyo ko dikende pohuma, unone aa yoya ko diywi dyodihe edi di tunda mu kanwa ka Nyambi.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Shamaonga ngou a twarire Yesu ku thsikuña thso shokenu thsa Yerusalema no ku ka mu thzinithsa pa mutuya o Tembere. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Wa mu amberire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Ngeci yowe o Mwana Nyambi o reere pashi, inene ku na ñoriwa ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Kenge a ku tumina tungeru twenthzi ci tu kwakwere ko moko ato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">ci thsidyato thsoe katere thsi kuruke ku diwe.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Ku na ñoriwa karo ci: ‘Katere o ereke Fumu Nyambi woe.’”<figure style="fig" alt="The pinnacle of the Temple" file="lb00249b.tif" size="col" loc="Mat 4:5-7" copy="Knowles" ref="4.5-7">Mutuya o Tembere</figure><verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Karo shamaonga wa mu twarire pa mukinya oure nene no ku ka mu monithsa ofumu ouhe o kaye no kutethzima kwao. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Wa mu amberire ci: “Kenge ni ku pa yoihe eyi, ngeci o tongame ku ni rombera.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu ngou a mu amberire ci: “O tunde ku kwange Satana, inene ku na ñoriwa ci: ‘O rombere Fumu Nyambi woe, karo o kwamene aye pohuma.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Shamaonga ngou a thsiire Yesu, tungeru twa keyire no ku na mu kwamena.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tateka ekwama yenthzi mu Galilea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu ou a yuvire ci Johani Mukwakukorovethza na a pakiwa mu kamenga, wa hukire ku Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Wa tundire mu Nazareta no ku ka tunga mu Kapenauma po pepi no Diviya dya Galilea, mu ditunga dya Zabuloni na Nafetali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Eyi ya tendaharire ci i citombore neyi a ñorire mukwakukethza Isaya ci:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Ditunga dya Zabuloni nedi dya Nafetali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">mu dikuñwa dyo ku thza ku diwate, mu thsambwadiya thza Jorodani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilea wAnukenge,<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />anu awa a yoya mu mirema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">a na mono mwethzi oukuru!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Awa a yoya mu ditunga dyo muthzimbimbi o kufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">mwethzi u na wa munekera!”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ku tunda ethso thsikati, Yesu wa tatekire ku honga ci: “Mu cere evi yenu, inene Kutumina ko ku Wiru pepi ku di.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa erongwa yo kutanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu o ku thza o enda ku mukenga o Diviya dya Galilea, wa monine munu na minenthzi, Simoni oyu wethsiwire karo ci Peturu na minenthzi Andereasi o kwa konthzera dituwa dyo mu Diviya, inene nedi eyambi yothsi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mu keye mu ni shupwere na ni mi rongithse ku yamba anu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Popo mwene a thsiire matuwa o no ku mu shupwera.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ou a endireko ku tunda apo, wa monine karo munu na minenthzi, Jakovo na minenthzi Johani ana Zebedea aidi, awa ekarire mu wato na tata wo Zebedea o kwa honga matuwa o. Yesu wa wethsire, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />popo a thsiire wato no tata wo, no ku mu shupwera.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calls disciples to follow Him" file="cn01681c.tif" size="col" loc="Mat 4:18-22" copy="Cook" ref="4.18-22">Yesu aethsa erongwa ci i mu shupwere</figure><verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rongithsa no ku porithsa anu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu wa thzire o pita mu Galilea yomuhe o ku thza o rongithsa mu masinagoge o no ku honga yo Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina ko ku Wiru, no ku porithsa ekora yo mishovoshovo yoihe no mawethzi mu kaci kanu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Kapupo ka Yesu ka henyine mu ditunga dya Siria momuhe. Anu a retire ku kwenthzi akwakukora ekora yo mishovoshovo, mawethzi oakuru, akwamathzimu, akwathsinyonya, nakwakuara. Yesu wa wa porithsire wahe. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Anu owangi a mu shupwerire awa a tundire mu Galilea, mu Mambongi Dikumi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po Dekapolisi, ku amba ci “Mambongi o dikumi.”</char></note> mu Yerusalema, Judea, no mandau o mu thsambwadiya thzo Rware rwa Jorodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo pa mukinya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-7:29">5.1—7.29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu ou a monine mbunga, wa thzire pa mukinya no ku kekara. Erongwa yenthzi ya keyire ku kwenthzi, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />ngou a tatekire ku i rongithsa.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiyauthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />Wa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">“Akwathsiyauthzi ahepwe mu mupepo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">inene Kutumina ko ku Wiru po kwo.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a di mu thsidiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">inene kenge mba hengawethziwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a cihuthsa kushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">inene kenge mba tambura kaye.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a fa nthzara no dinotwa dyowawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">inene kenge mba rakwithsiwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a di no ñeke kwamweya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">inene Nyambi naye kenge mba ekara no ñeke kukwo.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a di no micima thzothzikenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">inene kenge mba mona Nyambi.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a retera anu amweya thsiyaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">inene kenge mbethsiwa ana Nyambi.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a nyandithsiwa mukaci ko ku kwama owawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">inene Kutumina ko ku Wiru po kwo.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Mwakwa thsiyauthzi ngeci anu aa mi tukathzana, ku mi nyandithsa no ku mi shangethza yoimango yo mishovoshovo mukaci ko ku ni shupwera. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Mu roere no ku nyanyuka, inene muyambo wenu mu wiru po ukuru. Nakwakukethza o kukare dya wa tendire nawo.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungwa no mwethzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Yamwe mwa mungwa o kaye. Unone ngeci mungwa u na tutukwa ne ngepi nga u kwamiwa karo ci u toware? Tumba u kwathsa thsimweya karo shime ku mwaiwera pora no ku dyatadyatiwa kwanu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Yamwe mwa mwethzi o kaye. Thsikuña thso ku umberiwa pa mukinya tumba thsi tawa ku horekiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Karo kwithsa munu o ku muneka kambarambara no ku ka furumeka kafuma, unone aa ka paka pa thsimeko ci ka munekere wahe awa a di mu nthzio. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Mofoci namwe, mu thsie mwethzi wenu u munekere anu ci a mone ekwama yenu yoiwa no ku shangara Tata wenu o ku wiru.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo Murao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mwa anekera ci naa keyera ku na pwithsa murao nerongithsa yakwakukethza, dyombo! Ka na ni keyera ku na i pwithsa, unone ku na i roithserera. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci diwiru no kaye o ku i shime ku pwa, kwithsa shaanga kataku ko shoonye nji kakwenyukwenyu aka ka ñoriwire mu murao aka ka ku tundithsiwamo, shime enu yoihe o ku i na kwanenena. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Munu yomuhe o ku corapo shaanga thso shoonye peyo eraerera no ku rongithsa amweya ku tenda kengeyo, kenge a kwithsiwa ci muonye mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru. Uno honi o ku i hengeka no ku i rongithsa amweya, kenge a kwithsiwa o mukuru mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru.<verse eid="MAT 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ngeci owawa wenu ka wa kupita wAfarithsi narongithsi o murao, mbera ka mwingena mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa mukaci koanthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12.57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mwa yuva eyi ya ambiwire kwakwathsañuru kukare ci: ‘Kadi o mukwa kwipaa, karo munu yomuhe o kwipaa aa roera ku raturiwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Unone ame naa mi ambera ci yomuhe o ku anthzipera muenthzenthzi, kenge a ku raturiwa. Karo, yomuhe o ku shwahura muenthzenthzi kenge a ku twariwa mu Nthzango. Karo noyu o ku ambera muenthzenthzi ci: ‘Owe o thsitomba!’ Aa roera mudiro o dihere.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />“Mweyo, ngeci waa pa nupu pa katara owepo vuruka ci muenthzoe o na ku anthzipera, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />o thsie nupu thzoe pa rupara ro katara no ku thza. O huke tango o ka ciamburwere na muenthzoe mbeci o keye ku na tupura nupu thzoe.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“O ciyuve na mukwathsithzimbo thsoe wanguwangu o ku mu di mu dikuñwa ku thza ku kuta. Inene ngeci amwepo mu ka kumako, kenge a ka ku twara kwa mukwakuratura, aye mukwakuratura kenge a ka ku pa mu moko o tupathso ci tu ka ku konthzere mu kamenga. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Naa ku tongwera yoshemwa ci ko wa ku tundamo shime ou wa ku manenena ku kura murandu ouhe.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa keyi yo mirembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mwa yuva eyi ya ambiwire ci: ‘Kadi o mukwa ku rembeka.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Unone ame naa mi ambera ci yomuhe o ku kenga mbuyama no ku u cikumbwethza, o na mu rembeka kare mu mucima wenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ngeci dithziho dyoe dyo rudyo adyopo di ku twara ku thsivi, o di thzongoremo no ku di konthza. Ku di nawa ku yawa thsirama thsofoci kwirama yoe, kupita ci erama yoe yoihe i konthzeriwe mu dihere. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Karo ngeci dyoko dyoe dyo rudyo adyopo di ku twara ku thsivi, o di teteko no ku di konthza. Ku di nawa ku yawa thsirama thsofoci kwirama yoe, kupita ci erama yoe yoihe i thze mu dihere.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa mukaci ko kufa ko maruo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Mañoro karo aa amba ci: ‘Mukwerume yomuhe o ku rukurura munuwenthzi aa roera ku mu pa diñoro dyo ku mu rukurura.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Unone ame naa mi ambera ci ngeci mukwerume ayepo rukurura munuwenthzi, aa mu retera ci ekare o mirembe ngeci ayepo yekiwa kwa wao, shime ngeci aa mu rukurwera peamba yo mirembe. Karo no mukwerume o ku yeka mbuyama o ku rukururiwa o na rembeka.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa mukaci ko kwethza ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Karo mwa yuva edi kwa ambiwire kwakwathsañuru ci: ‘Mwethza ngoro mwinu eyi mwa ku kwanga ku kwama. Unone mu kwamene Fumu enu eyi na mu mu kumbwethza ku mu kwamena.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Unone ame naa mi tongwera ci mwethza ngoro shaanga kamanana, ikare ko diwiru, inene thzodiyo ngunja thza Nyambi, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />nji ko kaye, inene thsodiyo thsipura thso mauru enthzi, nji ko Yerusalema, inene thsodiyo thsikuña thsa Fumu Shokuru. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Karo wethza ngoro ko mutwi woe, inene tumba o twethsa ku pirura shaanga dihuki dyofoci ci dikare dyodikenu nji dyodiru. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Mu ambe pohuma ci: ‘Ii’ nji ci ‘Dyombo.’ Yo ku shumuna kweyo yaa tunda koyu o mumango.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa mukaci ko kuhuthsera omango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6.29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mwa yuva ci kwa ambiwire kenge ci: ‘Dithziho no dithziho, dieo no dieo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Unone ame naa mi ambera ci mwa kanena munu o mumango. Ngeci munu aa ku mbandura ku ditama dyo rudyo, o mu tengekere nedi dimweya kengeyo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ngeci munu aa ku twara ku kuta ku ka ku thzekithsa ci a shimbe hembe woe, o mu pe no vaki woe kengeyo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Ngeci munu aa ku ootera ku mu shimbera mupango wenthzi kanano kofoci, o u mu shimbere tunano twidi. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />O pe oyu na ku rombo, karo wa kanena oyu na foto ku korota ku koe.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu shime akwethzimbo yenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6.27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mwa yuva ci shime kwa ambiwire ci: ‘O shime muenthzoe no ku thzimba mukwathsithzimbo thsoe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Unone ame naa mi ambera ci: ‘Mu shime akwethzimbo yenu no ku romberera awa a mi nyandithsa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Ngeci amwepo mu tenda kengeyo, kenge mu monithsa shemwa ci mwana Tata wenu o ku wiru, aye oyu na vithseranga diyuwa dyenthzi anu owamango nowa owawa, no ku rokithseranga mvura anu owawawa nowa o dipethso. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ngeci amwepo mu shima pohuma awa a na mi shimi ne, muyambo mwine mwa ku wana? Kadi aterithsi nawo aa kwamanga kengeyo? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Karo ngeci amwepo mu vumenenanga pohuma aenthzenu ne, mwaa pita ngepi amweya? Kadi no mahedeni dya na kwamanga? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Mweyo, mwikare o kwononoka eci edi a di o kwononoka Tata wenu o ku wiru.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CC, HS, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa mukaci ko ku kwathsa ahepwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mu mamere ci mwa kwamena ekwama yenu yowawa pa meho anu ci a mi shangarerepo. Kamona amwepo mu tenda kengeyo, ka mwa ku wana muyambo kwa Tata wenu o ku wiru.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Mweyo, yoihe o kwathsa oyu na piri, wa i monithsa kwanu eci edi a na tendanga akwamahetaheta mu masinagoge no mu makuñwa. Eyo po aa i tenderanga ci anu a wa shangare. Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci na wana kare muyambo wo. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Unone owe yoihe o kwathsa oyu na piri, o mu pere ku mukunda ci shaanga dyoko dyoe dyo rumoho dya dimuka eyi di tenda dyo rudyo, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />ci kupa koe kwikare ko ku mukunda. Tata woe oyu na mono yo ku mukunda kenge a ku ku pa muyambo.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa mukaci ko ku rombera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Yoihe mu rombera, mwa tendanga eci edi a na tendanga akwamahetaheta awa a na shimanga kwimana mu masinagoge no pa mahanganthzira ci a wa mone anu wahe. Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci na wana kare muyambo wo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Uno honi owe yoihe o rombera, o thze mu kapingwethzi koe, o yanthzere thsero no ku rombera kwa Tata woe ku mukunda. Mweyo, Tata woe oyu na mono eyi o tenda ku mukunda kenge a ku ku pa muyambo.” <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />O ku mu rombera ka mu roerire ku torombosha eci edi a na tendanga mahedeni awa a na anekeranga ci Nyambi aa twethsa ku wa yuva ko ku amba maywi oangi nene. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mwa cipiturano, inene Tata wenu o na dimuka eyi mu na foto o ku mu shime no ku i romba.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />“Mweyo mu rombere kenge ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“ ‘Tata wetu oyu di mu wiru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">dithzina dyoe di hengekiwe dyodikenu,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Kutumina koe kwiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">eshima yoe i tendiwe pano pa kaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">eci edi i di mu wiru.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />O tu pe rero edya yetu yo diyuwa no diyuwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />O tu tetere mirandu thzetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">eci edi tu na teteranga natwe awa a na twipithseranga.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Karo wa tu twara mwitumaura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">unone o tu amwene koyu o Mumango. [Inene kutumina po koe, nokoro, no kutethzima, diyere na diyere. Ameni.’]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Inene kamona mu tetera amweya mirandu thzo, no Tata wenu o ku wiru kenge a ku mi tetera namwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Unone ngeci kadi mwakwa ku tetera amweya mirandu thzo, no Tata wenu ka a ku mi tetera namwe mirandu thzenu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa mukaci ko kucikanga no nthzara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Yoihe mu cikanga no nthzara, ka mu roerire ku monahara ku fwinyutuka mu rupara eci edi a na tendanga akwamahetaheta. Inene a fwinyutukanga mu rupara ci anu wahe a dimuke ci aa cikanga no nthzara. Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci na wana kare muyambo wo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Unone owe ngeci waa cikanga no nthzara, o cihupe ku rupara no ku shakura huki thzoe, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />o tende kengeyo ci anu katere a dimuke ci waa cikanga no nthzara. I moniwe pohuma kwa Tata woe shimoniwa, aye o ku mona enu yoihe yo ku mukunda kenge a ku ku pa muyambo.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rufumo ro ku wiru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Mwa cipakera rufumo pano pashi, apa pa di menje no ñarawe, apa pa di ethzi o ku twethsa ku tuva manthzio enu no kwithza. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Unone mu cipakere rufumo ku wiru, ko kupira menje no ñarawe yo ku rwipithsa, omu ku na piri nethzi o ku twethsa ku tuva manthzio no kwithza. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Inene oku ru di rufumo rwoe no mucima woe kodiyo u di.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwethzi werama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Dithziho po odiyo mumunyi werama. Ngeci dithziho dyoe dyaa mona nawa, erama yoe yoihe yaekara mu mwethzi. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Unone ngeci meho oe ka a mona nawa, erama yoe yoihe yaekara mu mirema. Ngeci mwethzi ou u di ku koe awopo wikara mirema, ethzo mirema kenge thza kwikara thzothzikuru nene.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa cithzekera</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Kwithsa munu o ku twethsa ku kwamena añathsire aidi. Inene kenge a thzimbapo yofoci no ku shima yumweya, nji ku remekapo yumweya no ku shwahura yumweya. Tumba mu twethsa ku kwamena Nyambi no ku kwamena madi.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Mweyo, naa mi ambera ci mwa cithzekera yo mwoyo wenu ci ine mwa ku dya nji ku nwa, nji ci ine mwa ku vata. Ene mwoyo ne kadi ukuru mu thsivaka kupita edya, nerama ikuru mu thsivaka kupita evata? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Mu monene kwinyunyi, ka ya dima nji ku cora nji ku paka edya mwitaravo, unone Tata wenu o ku wiru aa i rera. Amwe po kadi mwakuru nene mu thsivaka ku i pita? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Edye ku kwenu o ku twethsa ku shumuna ku mwoyo wenthzi shaanga thsitunde thsofoci pohuma ko ku cithzekera?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Ine yo ku cithzekerera yevata? Mu mone matemo o mu murundu edi a kura, ka a kwama nji ku hota wanda, <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />unone naa mi tongwera ci shaanga Fumu Solomoni mu kutethzima kwenthzi kokuhe ka ekarire nevata yoiwa eci ao matemo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ngeci Nyambi aa twethsa ku vateka kengeyo muhonyi o mu murundu o kuninga ci rero ko u di, peunthza waa kuheriwa mu dirungu ne, ene nga ka a twethsa ku mi yenga amwe? Mayuwane amwe mwanu mwa shopu thsitawo?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Mweyo, mwa cithzekera ci: ‘Ine twa ku dya?’ nji ci ‘Ine twa ku nwa?’ nji ci ‘Ine twa ku vata?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Inene eyi yoihe po yodiyo a na randarandanga mahedeni. Tata wenu o ku wiru po o na dimuka ci yaa fotahara ku kwenu yoihe eyi. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Unone mu fote tango Kutumina kwa Nyambi nowawa wenthzi, aye kenge a ku mi pa eyi enu yoihe.<verse eid="MAT 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />“Mweyo, mwa cithzekera ne honi keyi yo peunthza, inene diyuwa dyo peunthza kenge dya ku keya necithzekera yadyo. Diyuwa no diyuwa di di no mapacaca adyo.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Mwa ratura aenthzenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6.37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Mwa ratura ci namwe katere mwa ku raturiwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Inene dyodi mu ratura amweya namwe dyo mwa ku raturiwa. Thsothsi thsianekethzithso mu cikwathsithsa, thsothsa ku cikwathsithsiwa ku kwenu.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />“Ngepi edi nga o mona kahonyi aka ka di mu dithziho dya muenthzoe, owe o ku di no thsithsini mu dithziho dyoe? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ngepi edi nga o ambera muenthzoe ci: ‘O keye ni ku toore kahonyi aka ka di mu dithziho dyoe, owe o ku di no thsithsini mu dithziho dyoe?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Owe o mukwamahetaheta, o tange tango ku tundithsa thsithsini ethsi thsi di mu dithziho dyoe, mbeci o mone nawa no ku tundithsa kahonyi aka ka di mu dithziho dya muenthzoe.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mwa pa mbwa enu yoikenu, inene kenge thzi mi piruka no ku mi papaura. Karo mwa konthzera nguru enu yenu yoikuru mu thsivaka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mawe oakuru mu thsivaka aa a nethsiwa mapiare.</char></note> inene kenge thzi i dyatadyata pohuma.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu rombe kenge mwa ku piwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Mu rombe kenge mwa ku piwa, mu fote kenge mwa ku wana, mu ngongomone kenge mwa ku yanthzurweriwera. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Inene munu yomuhe o ku romba aa piwa, o ku fota aa wana, karo kwaa yanthzurweriwa oyu na ngongomona.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />“Ene kwaa di ku kwenu oyu nga pa mwanenthzi diwe o ku na rombo dikende? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Nji ku mu pa diyoka o ku na rombo ethsi? Dyombo! <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ngeci honi amwe mwanu owamango mwaa dimuka ku pa anenu enu yoiwa, aye Tata wenu o ku wiru ne ya ku kuma kupi enu yoiwa eyi a ku pa awa a na rombo ku kwenthzi! <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Yoihe eyi mu na foto ku mi kwama anu amweya, namwe mu wa kwame kengeyo, inene no murao wa Mushe nakwakukethza dyo i na amba.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsero thzo kuciomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Mwingenene mu thsero thzo kuciomba, inene thsero thzo ku twara ku kunongithsiwa po thza ku vapuka, no dikuñwa edi di thzako dya pururu, karo nowa a na endangamo angi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Unone thsero thzo ku twara ku mwoyo po thza kuciomba, no dikuñwa edi di thzako dikaru, owapu pohuma o ku di wana.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitondo no ima yathso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6.43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mu mamere akwakukethza o mbango, aa monahara eci mangu o kwa keya ku kwenu, unone mu kaciko po winthzi shemwa o ku kwavura. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Kenge mwa ku wa dimuka ketenda yo. Ene kenge nga mu koyora ñuyu ku musheunga, nji ku teta thsikocera thso ñangare ku wondo? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Thsitondo thsothsiwa thsa kwima ima yoiwa, karo thsitondo thsothsimango thsa kwima ima yoimango. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Thsitondo thsothsiwa tumba thsimi ima yoimango, karo thsitondo thsothsimango tumba thsimi ima yoiwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Thsitondo thsothsihe thso kukana kwima ima yoiwa, thsaa henduriwa no ku konthzeriwa mu mudiro. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Mweyo honi, kenge mwa ku dimuka akwakukethza o mbango ketenda yo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongwa shemwa neyi yo mbango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Kadi cingwa anu wahe awa a na nithsanga ci: ‘Fumu, Fumu,’ kenge a ku kengena mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru, dyombo! Unone shime awa a tenda eshima ya Tata o ku wiru. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mu diyuwa dyo raturo owangi kenge a ku ni ambera ci: ‘Fumu, Fumu, shime twa okethza mu dithzina dyoe no ku cithza mathzimu mu dithzina dyoe, no ku kwama ekomokithsa yoingi!’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Unone ame kenge na ku wa ambera ci: ‘Na diyerire ku mi dimuka amwe, mu tunde ku kwange amwe mwakwa ku shwahura murao wa Nyambi!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kakwakuumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Mweyo, yomuhe o ku keya ku kwange no ku yuva aa maywi ange no ku a hengeka, aa cipitura eci munu o munyanyami oyu wa umberire nthzio thzenthzi pa diwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mvura wa rokire, meyu o ku pupa a keyire, no dipepo dya ngundungire ku tamba apo pa nthzio, unone ka thza umburukire pakuninga ci shime a thzi shisherire pa diwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Unone munu yomuhe o ku yuva maywi ange no kukana ku a hengeka, aa cipitura eci munu o mutomba oyu wa umberire nthzio thzenthzi pa diveevee. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mvura wa rokire, meyu o ku pupa a keyire, no dipepo dya ngundungire. Yoihe eyo ya tambirepo no ku umburura nthzio. Kuumburuka kwathzo kwepire nene ku piterera.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okoro wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyo, mbunga thza komokire erongithsa yenthzi, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />inene shime a rongithsire kokoro, kadi eci arongithsi o murao.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="rem">LK, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwengondwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu ou a urumukire ku tunda pa mukinya, mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu shupwerire. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Popo mukwerume wengondwe wa keyire no ku na tongama ku rupara rwa Yesu no ku amba ci: “Fumu, nga o i shime kenge nga o ni porithsa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyo mukwengondwe shime a rombire Yesu ci a mu kenithse. Ku kwama kengeyo ya ningire ci Yesu shime a mu porithse.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu wa ororire dyoko ku mu kwata, no ku amba ci: “Ni na i shimi, o pore!” Popo engondwe yenthzi ya pwire. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yesu ngou a mu amberire ci: “O na mono, katere o ka i tongwere munu eyi, unone o thze o ka ciyareke kwa mupurisita. O ka punithse thsikunda thsombangi kwanu wahe thso kuporithsiwa koe eci dyodi a i raire Mushe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Mali 14.1-32</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mupika muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Popa engenine Yesu mu Kapenauma, muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma wa mu shambawerire no ku mu adikanena ci a mu kwathse. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Wa mu amberire ci: “Fumu, mupikange mu nthzio a di o na rara, aa kora nene. Kadi wa ku twethsa ku enda karo aa shupeka nene.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Kenge ni thza ni ka mu porithse.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Unone oyo muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma wa tawire ci: “Dyombo Fumu, ka i roerire ci owe o wingene mu nthzio thzange. Unone o ambe pohuma diywi, mupikange kenge a pora. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Inene name mushi thzokoro thzowa a na ni endithsa ni di, karo name ni di no mashwarare aa ni na endithsa. Ku ambera yumweya ci: ‘O thze,’ aa thza. Ku tumina yumweya ci: ‘O keye,’ aa keya. Ku ambera mupikange ci: ‘O kwame eyi,’ aa i kwama.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu ou a yuvire eyo, wa komokire nene no ku ambera awa a mu shupwerire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ka na ni mono karo munu o thsitawo thsothsikuru eci ethsi muno mu Isiraele yomuhe. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Naa mi tongwera ci anu owangi kenge a ku tunda ku muvo no ku mutoko, no ku nekara ku thsidika na Aburahama, Isaka, na Jakovo mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Unone awa a na roera kwikaramo omu mu Kutumina kenge a ku konthzeriwa pora mu mirema. Omo kenge kwa kwikara ku dira no ku cihuma nwaeo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Yesu ngou a amberire oya muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma ci: “O huke ku diumbo kenge o kwameniwa eyi o na foto dyodi o na i tawa.” Mo muya mu thsikati mupikenthzi wa porire.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa anu owangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu ou a thzire ku nthzio thza Peturu, wa ka wanine ngumwenya Peturu o ku na rara o ku kora dihokoma. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Wa mu kwatire ku dyoko, no dihokoma dya mu pwire. Wa pindukire ku tunda podidi no ku tateka ku mu roithsera edya.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Runguro o ku pa neraura pashi, anu a retire kwa Yesu anu o mathzimu owangi, aye wa na a cithzire ko diywi pohuma no ku porithsa akwakukora wahe. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Wa tendire kengeyo ci i citombore neyi a ambire mukwakukethza Isaya yo ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">“Na a shimbi mawethzi etu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">no ku cikambeka ekora yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku shupwera Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu ou a monine anu owangi o kwa na mu thzingwera, wa raererire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Tu thzenu mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya.” <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Ngou a keyire ku kwenthzi murongithsi o murao oyu wa mu amberire ci: “Murongithsi, kenge ni thza noe kokuhe oku o thza.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Mbwawa thzi di no mateke, nenyunyi i di no mataratara, uno honi Mwana Munu aye ka a di no nthzio thzo ku rara.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Thsirongwa thsimweya thsa amberire Yesu ci: “Fumu, o ni tawethze ni thze tango ni ka vumbeke tata.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Unone Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O ni shupwere, o thsie afu a vumbeke aenthzo afu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tutwarithsa dyungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu wa yomamine mu wato nerongwa yenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Popo dyungu dyodikuru nene dya katukire mu diviya no mañithsingi a yarithsire meyu mu wato. Unone Yesu aye o ku di pa turo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Erongwa ya henyenine ku kwenthzi no ku mu pindura ci: “Fumu, o tu yoyithse, twaa fa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Wa tawire ci: “Amwe mwa shopu thsitawo, ine eyi mu yapa?” Ngou emanine no ku kuturura mupepo no mañithsingi, popo akopo ku onga kuruu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Wahe a komokire no ku cipaura ci: “Oyu munu ne wa ngepi, o ku ninga ci shaanga mipepo no mañithsingi yaa mu yuvera!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa akwerume aidi o mathzimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu ou a ka kumine mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya, mu ditunga dyo Magadareni, a mu hanganyekire akwerume aidi o mathzimu, awa ekarangire pa mararo. Shime a ciperururire ku ninga ci kwithsa munu oyu wa twethsire ku pitera edyo dikuñwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />A kumbire ci: “Ine eyi o fota ku kwetu, owe o Mwana Nyambi? Ene waa keyera ku na tu nyandithsa thsikati thsetu o ku thsi shime ku kuma nji?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Po pare kamananano, kwekarire mutanga oukuru o nguru ou wa dyererirepo. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Mipepo thzothzimango thza adikanenine Yesu ci: “Ngeci waa tu cithza, o tu tawethze ku kengena mo uya mutanga o nguru.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu wa thzi amberire ci: “Mu thze!” Ngou thza tundire kowaya akwerume no ku kengena mu nguru. Popo mutanga ouhe wa urumukire ku tunda pa muurumuko ku ka cirundumwethza mu diviya, no ku ka feramo ku meyu. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Awa thzi futithsire a cirire no ku thza mu diumbo no ku ka tongora enu yoihe eyi ya tendaharire kowaya akwerume o mathzimu. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Mbongi thzothzihe thza keyire ku shambawera Yesu. Ou a ka kumine, a ka mu adikanenine ci a tunde mu ditunga dyo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa munu o kuara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu wa yomamine mu wato, ku yavuka ku thza mu mbongi omu a kurerire. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Anu amweya a retire mukwerume o kuara o ku na rara podidi. Yesu ou a monine thsitawo thso, wa amberire oya mukwerume o kuara ci: “O tanare mucima mwanange, evi yoe i na teteriwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Arongithsi amweya o murao a anekerire mu micima thzo ci: “Oyu munu aa yengwa!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu wa dimukire eanekera yo, ngou a wa amberire ci: “Ine eyi mu anekerera yoimango mu micima thzenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Thsothsoto ne thsipi no ku amba ci: ‘Evi yoe i na teteriwa,’ nji ku amba ci: ‘O katuke o ende’? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Naa mi monithsa honi ci Mwana Munu po o di nokoro mu kaye o ku tetera evi.” Ngou a amberire oyo mukwakuara ci: “O katuke, o shimbe kanaha koe, o thze ku diumbo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Oyo mukwerume wa katukire no ku thza ku diumbo. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Mbunga ou thza monine eyi, thza yapire nene no ku shangara Nyambi pa ku pa okoro o kengeyo kwanu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aethsa Mateu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu o ku tunda muya mu ndau wa monine muterithsi o dithzina dyo Mateu o ku nekara mu ofithsi thzenthzi. Wa mu amberire ci: “O ni shupwere!” Popo Mateu wa katukire no ku mu shupwera.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu o ku dya murarero mu nthzio thza Mateu, aterithsi owangi nanu wevi a dire nenthzi nerongwa yenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Afarithsi ou a i monine epurire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Murongithsi wenu ne ine eyi a dyera naterithsi nanu wevi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu ou a i yuvire, wa ambire ci: “O kukana ku kora tumba foto mukwakupanga, shime anu o ku kora wodiyo o ku fota mukwakupanga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Unone mu thze mu ka fotithsithse eyi a amba aa maywi o kuninga ci: ‘Naa fota ñeke kadi eyambero yeyama.’ Inene ka na ni keyera ku nethsa owawawa, unone naa keyera anu wevi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudi mukaci ko ku cikanga no nthzara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Erongwa ya Johani yepurire Yesu ci: “Erongwa yoe ne ine eyi i na kananga ku cikanganga no nthzara eci edi tu na tendanga atwe nAfarithsi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Ene ambusha mukwakuyeka ne kenge nga ekara mu mathsiwa o kwa di na mukwakuyeka nji? Dyombo! Unone thsikati thsaa keya mukwakuyeka ou a ku tundithsiwa mu kaciko, mbeci a ku cikange no nthzara.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Kwithsa munu o ku fumena thsikamba thso thsito thsothsipe pa thsito thsothsikurukuru, inene thsikamba thso thsito thsothsipe kenge thsi cikokera no ku yatukapo no ku kwama dicumbwa dyodikuru kupita pa kutanga. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Kwithsa munu o ku rongera waine omupe mu tuhupa totukurukuru. Ngeci ayepo tenda kengeyo, tuhupa totukurukuru kenge tu yatuka. Waine kenge a mwaara no tuhupa kenge twipa. Waine omupe a roera ku rongeriwa mu tuhupa totupe. Mweyo, momu widi wayo kenge ikara nawa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana Jairosi o mbuyamaana no mbuyama o kukora</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu o ku amba eyi kukwo, muendithsi o Majuda wa keyire no ku na tongama ku manwi no ku amba ci: “Mwanange o mbuyamaana ñanyiñanyi a na fu. Unone o keye o ka mu kambeke dyoko dyoe karo kenge a yoya.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu wa katukire nerongwa yenthzi no ku thza nenthzi.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Popo mbuyama oyu wa korire diropa myaka thzo dikumi na thzidi wa keyire munyima thza Yesu. Wa kwatire ku minganja thzo thsikoveyo thsa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Shime a anekerire ci: “Nga o ni kwate shaanga ku thsikoveyo thsenthzi kenge nga ni pora.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu wa pirukire, ou a mu monine, wa mu amberire ci: “O tanare mucima mwanange, thsitawo thsoe thsi na ku yoyithsa.” Popo oya mbuyama wa porire.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yesu ou a ka kumine ku nthzio thzoyo muendithsi, wa ka wanine anu o kwemba membo o thsidiro no mbunga o ku thzi firika. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Ngou a ambire ci: “Mu pune pora, oyu mbuyamaana ka a fire aa rara pohuma.” Unone awo a mu teururire. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Munyima thzo ku punithsera mbunga pora, Yesu wengenine mu nthzio no ku kwata oyo mbuyamaana ku dyoko ayepo pinduka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Muthzimbu weyo wa yukire nene mo diya ditunga dyodihe.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa tupuputwa no shiamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu o ku tunda muya mu ndau, akwerume aidi o tupuputwa a mu shupwerire o kwa ka thza o kumba ci: “Mwana Davida, o tu fere ñeke!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu ou engenine mu nthzio, tupuputwa twa keyire ku kwenthzi. Ngou a twipurire ci: “Ene mwaa tawa ci kenge nga ni twethsa ku tenda kengeyo nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Oto tupuputwa twa tawire ci: “Ii, Fumu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Yesu ngou a wa kwatire pa meho no ku amba ci: “Kokuthza ko thsitawo thsenu, i dikare kengeyo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Popo meho o a thsikukire. Yesu wa wa nomenithsire nene ci: “Katere mu i tongwere munu eyi!” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Unone awo a thzire o yukithsa ya Yesu mu ditunga dyodihe.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Popa a thzire awo, anu a retire kwa Yesu munu o muthzimu, ou wa mu kwangithsire ku amba. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Mupepo oumango ou wa mu tundire, shiamba wa twethsire ku amba. Anu a komokire nene no ku amba ci: “Twa diyerire ku mona enu yo kenge ku i tendahara mu Isiraele!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Unone Afarithsi a ambire ci: “Ñathsire o mathzimu oyu mu pa okoro o ku cithza mathzimu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa fera anu ñeke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Diyuwa dimweya Yesu wa thzire o pita mu mambongi oahe no mu maumbo. Wa thzire o rongithsa mu masinagoge no ku honga yo Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina ko ku Wiru, no ku porithsa ekora yo mishovoshovo yoihe no mawethzi. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ou a monine mbunga, wa thzi yuverire ñekeñeke, inene shime thza shupekire no ku topwera eci mangu o kupira mudithsani. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ngou a amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Dicora adyo po dikuru shemwa, unone akwakucora awo apu. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Mweyo, mu rombere kwa Fumu o dicora ci a tume akwakucora owangi mu dicora dyenthzi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Tunganda to dikumi na twidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu wethsire erongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi, no ku i pa okoro o ku cithza mathzimu, ku porithsa mishovo thzothzihe thzekora no mawethzi.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Mathzina oto tunganda to dikumi na twidi po aa: O kutanga po Simoni oyu nethsiwa ci Peturu, no Andereasi minenthzi, Jakovo na minenthzi Johani ana Zebedea, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipu no Batolomeu, Tomasi no Mateu o muterithsi, Jakovo mwana Alufea, no Tadea, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni o Zeloti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diywi dyo Thsigerike dyaa amba ci munu oyu na shimi nene thsinu.</char></note> no Judasi Isikariota oyu wa ombire Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tuma oto tunganda to dikumi na twidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu wa tumine oto tunganda to dikumi na twidi no ku tu raerera ci: “Mwa thza kwAnukenge nji kwingena mu mambongi o Masamaria. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Uno honi mu thze pohuma ku mangu o kuyonga a Isiraele. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Mu thze mu ka wa honge ci: ‘Kutumina ko ku Wiru pepi ku di!’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Mu ka porithse akwakukora no ku pindura afu, mu ka porithse akwengondwe no ku cithza mathzimu. Mwaa piwa kengekenge, namwe mu ka pe kengekenge.<verse eid="MAT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />“Mwa shimba madi o gauda, nji o silivera, nji o kopa mwipaupau yenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Karo omu mu ruendo mwa shimba mukotana nji ku shimba thsikoveyo thso muthsidi, mashangu nji muramu o ku endera. Inene mukwakukwama aa roera ku dyera pekwama yenthzi.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Yoihe mu kuma mu mbongi nji mu diumbo, mu fotithsithse nawa ci mu wanemo munu oyu nga roera ku mi tambura. Ngeci amwepo mu mu wana, mwaa roera kwikara mu mwanda wenthzi shime ou mwa ku tundamo ku thza kumweya. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />O ku mwingena omo mu mwanda, mu ambe ci: ‘Thsiyaro thsikare nenu.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ngeci awa a di omo mu mwanda awopo a mi tambura, thsiyaro thsenu thsikare kukwo. Unone ngeci awa a di omo mu mwanda ka fotire, thsiyaro thsenu thsi mi hukere. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Yoihe mu kuma mu diumbo nji mu mwanda omu a na kana ku mi tambura, nji ku teerera ku maywi enu, mu tundemo. Karo o ku mu thza mu kukumune dikungu dyo kwidyato yenu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku mi kukumwena dikungu dyo ku mauru yaa monithsa ci mu na wa kana.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci mu diyuwa dyo raturo kenge ya kwikara tangonaho ku mambongi a Sodoma na Gomora kupita anu omo mu mbongi.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makando o ku rupara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mar 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Mu mone, naa mi tuma eci mangu mu kaci ko winthzi. Mweyo, mu nyanyame eci mayoka, karo mu pire thsothsimango eci makuci. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mu mamere, inene anu kenge a ku mi twara ku makuta, no ku ka mi mwashaura mu masinagoge o. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Kenge mwa ku twariwa ku manguvuru no mafumu mukaci kange ci mu ka pe ombangi ku kwo, noku kwAnukenge. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ou a ku mi kwata, mwa ku cithzekera dyo ku ka amba, nji ci ine yo ku ka amba. Inene mwethso thsikati Nyambi kenge a ku mi pa eyi mwa ku ka amba. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kadi yamwe mwa ku ka amba, unone Mupepo wa Tata wenu yo wa ku ka mi ambithsa.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Mukurwamunu kenge a ku omba minamunu ci a paiwe, no tatawamunu kenge a ku tenda kengeyo kwa mwanenthzi. Ana kenge a ku pirukera ashemi wo no ku wepaithsa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Anu wahe kenge a ku mi thzimba mukaci kange. Unone oyu wa ku citanarithsa ku ka kuma ku hura, kenge a ku yoyithsiwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Yoihe a mi nyandithsa mothzi mbongi, mu cirere mothzi thzimweya. Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ka mwa ku mana ku pita mu mambongi oahe a Isiraele, Mwana Munu o ku shime ku kuma.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Thsirongwa tumba thsi piti murongithsi wathso, no mupika tumba a piti ñathsire wenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ku di nawa thsirongwa ku cishoka na murongithsi wathso, no mupika ku cishoka na ñathsire wenthzi. Ene ngeci anu aethsa thsinda thsa nthzio ci Beelezebule, awa anuenthzi ne kadi kenge a ku wa ta mathzina oamango kupita edyo!<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu yape Nyambi, mwa yapa anu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Mweyo, mwa yapa anu! Ethsi thsi na thsikiwa thsothsihe kenge thsa ku thsikuriwa, karo neyi i na horekiwa kenge ya ku hokoriwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Eyi ni mi ambera mu mirema, mu ka i ambe mu mwethzi. Eyi mu yuva o ku i yaayiwa, mu thzine petuwa yo manthzio ku i tongora.<verse eid="MAT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />“Mwa yapa o kwipaa erama, unone kadi akwa ku twethsa kwipaa mwoyo. Unone mu yape pohuma Nyambi, aye o ku twethsa ku nongithsa erama no mwoyo mu dihere. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Kadi tundumbu twidi po twaa uriwa ko kawayawaya kofoci pohuma? Unone shaanga kengeyo, kwithsa shaanga kandumbu kofoci aka ka ku wera pashi Tata wenu o ku na kana ku i shima. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Eci amwe honi po no huki thzo ku mitwi thzenu na a thzi tara thzothzihe. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Mweyo, mwa yapa, amwe po mwakuru mu thsivaka kupita ndumbu thzothzingi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku citawera Krisitu pa meho anu nji ku mu hamura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12.8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Munu yomuhe oyu wa ku citawera pa meho anu ci wange, name kenge na ku u citawera pa meho a Tata oyu di mu wiru. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Unone yomuhe o ku ni hamura pa meho anu, name kenge na ku mu hamura pa meho a Tata o mu wiru.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka na ku retiwa thsiyaro, unone mwere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mwa anekera ci shime na ni reta thsiyaro mu kaye. Ka na ni reta thsiyaro, unone mwere na ni reta. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Inene naa keyera ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">“ ‘ana wakwerume a ku kane ku ciyuva natata wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">ana wambuyamaana a ku kane ku ciyuva namama wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">nambuyama a ku kane ku ciyuva nangumwenyo.<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Akwamwanda ofoci nenthzi munu wodiyo a kwikara akwethzimbo yenthzi.’<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Munu yomuhe o ku shima nene tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi kupita ame, ka a roerire kwikara wange. Noyu o ku shima nene mwanenthzi o mukwerumeana nji o mbuyamaana kupita ame, naye ka a roerire kwikara wange. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />O ku kana ku shimba mbinda thzenthzi no ku ni shupwera, ka a roerire kwikara wange. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Munu yomuhe o ku shima nene mwoyo wenthzi kenge a ku u yawa, unone yomuhe o ku yawa mwoyo wenthzi mukaci kange kenge a ku u wana.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miyambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mar 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Munu yomuhe o ku mi tambura, yame a na tambura. O ku ni tambura, aa tambura oyu na a ni tumu. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />O ku tambura mukwakukethza wa Nyambi mukaci ko kuninga ci mukwakukethza wa Nyambi, kenge a ku wana muyambo o ku cishoka nou wa mukwakukethza. O ku tambura munu o muwawa, pakuninga ci munu o muwawa a na tambura, naye kenge a ku wana muyambo o ku cishoka nou wa munu o muwawa. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Yomuhe oyu wa ku pa shaanga nganja thzo meyu o kwombora koyu shoonye kwirongwa yange, mukaci ko ku ninga ci thsirongwa thsange, naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci oya munu ka a ku yawa muyambo wenthzi.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Johani Mukwakukorovethza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu ou a manine ku raerera erongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi, wa thzire o rongithsa no ku honga Diywi dya Nyambi mu maumbo a Galilea.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Johani o ku di mu kamenga, wa yuvire ekwama ya Krisitu, wa tumine amweya kwirongwa yenthzi ku kepura Yesu ci: <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />“Ene yowe oya twa yuva ci kenge mba a keya nji, nji tu taterere wao?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Mu thze mu ka tongwere Johani eyi mu na mono neyi mu na yuvu. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Tupuputwa twaa mona, ekunga yaa enda, akwengondwe aa porithsiwa, akwa kufa matwi aa yuva, afu aa pinduriwa kwafu, Muthzimbu Ouwa waa hongiwa kwahepwe. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Wa thsiyauthzi munu o kukana ku kuñuka mukaci kange.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Erongwa ya Johani popa ya thzire, Yesu wa tatekire ku ambaura ya Johani ku mbunga ci: “Ou mwa thzire mu dikunguthsitu ne thsine mwa fotire ku ka mona? Dimbungu edi dya pungithsiwire ku mupepo nji? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Uno honi ne ine mwa ka monine? Munu o ku vata yoiwa nji? Dyombo, anu o ku vata evata yoiwa aekara mu manthzio o thsifumu. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Edye honi ne mwa ka monine? Ene mukwakukethza nji? Ii, naa mi tongwera ci oyo na mu ka mona po mukuru kupita mukwakukethza. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Johani yodiyo oyu i na ñoriwa yenthzi mu Mañoro ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">“ ‘Kenge na ku tuma kanganda kange ku rupara rwoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">ku ka ku roithsera dikuñwa dyoe.’<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci Johani Mukwakukorovethza mukuru kupita anu wahe awa erekiwa pano pashi. Uno honi o muonye mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru po mukuru kwa Johani. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Ku tunda mu thsikati ethsi a tatekire Johani Mukwakukorovethza ku honga shime ku na kuma thsino thsikati, Kutumina ko ku Wiru shime kwaa rwithsiwa kokoro, karo owangi na ereka ku ku pukura. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Murao wa Mushe nakwakukethza wahe shime ku na kuma thsikati thsa Johani okethzire yo Kutumina. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ngeci mu na ciroithsera ku tawa aa maywi, Johani po yodiyo Eliya oyu a ambire akwakukethza ci kenge mba a keya. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Oyu di no matwi o ku yuvithsa a yuve.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“No ine nga ni wa piturithsa anu o rerodino? Aa cipitura eci anuke awa a di pa mbanthza o kwethsa aenthzo ci:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“ ‘Tu na mi shikera pa paro membo o wenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">unone ka mu kinine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">Tu na mi mbera membo o pa thsidiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">unone karo ka mu dirire makuano.’<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />“Johani Mukwakukorovethza wa keyire ko kukana ku dya nene edya nji ku nwa waine, unone anu a ambire ci: ‘O di no mupepo oumango.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana Munu wa keyire no ku na dya no ku nwa, unone anu a amba ci: ‘Mu na mono oyu dyakudya no thsitakwa, mbusha waterithsi nanu wevi.’ Unone onyanyami wa Nyambi waa monithsiwa ci uwawa ketenda yao.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maumbo o kukana ku tawa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Yesu ngou a tatekire ku rwithsa maumbo omu a kwamine ongi wekomokithsa yenthzi, inene anu ka cerire etenda yo yoimango. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“O mukwothsimo owe o Korazini! O mukwothsimo owe o Betisaida! Inene ekomokithsa eyi na i kwamiwa ku kwenu, nga yaa kwamiwa mu Tire na Sidoni, nga na cera kare mirandu thzo no ku vata mathsaka, no ku ciwethsa mututwi ku monithsa ku cera mirandu thzo. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Shaanga kengeyo, naa mi tongwera ci mu diyuwa dyo raturo kenge kwa kwikara tangonaho ku Tire na Sidoni kupita amwe.<verse eid="MAT 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />“Karo owe o Kapenauma ne waa anekera ci kenge wa ku twariwa ku wiru nji? Dyombo! Kenge wa ku huweriwa pashi mu ndau thzafu. Inene ekomokithsa eyi na i kwamiwa ku koe, nga mu Sodoma, edi diumbo no rerodino nga ko di di. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Shaanga kengeyo, naa ku tongwera ci mu diyuwa dyo raturo kenge ya kwikara tangonaho ku ditunga dya Sodoma kupita owe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu keye ku kwange na mu turumwithse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Popo Yesu wa ambire ci: “Tata, Fumu o diwiru no kaye, naa kanderera ku koe pa ku horekera eyi enu owanyanyami nakwa maano, no ku i hokwera o kuninga eci anuke owaonye. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ii, Tata, no kwama kengeyo, inene modiyo no shimena.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Tata na a paka enu yoihe mu moko ange. Kwithsa oyu na dimuka Mwana shime Tata, karo kwithsa oyu na dimuka Tata shime Mwana nowa na a hangura Mwana ku wa hokwera Tata wenthzi.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Mu keye ku kwange amwe mwahe mu na aya mukaci ko mipango thzothziremu kenge na ni mi yooyerithsa. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mu shimbe njoko thzange mu thzi cikambeke, karo mu cirongithse ku kwange, inene no mukwa kuwamucima karo no mukwa kucihuthsa kushi. Myoyo thzenu kenge na thzi wana maturumwithsero. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Inene njoko thzange thzioto o ku shimba, karo mupango wange urethzu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="rem">LK, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu po Fumu o diyuwa dyo Savata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Kethsiya thsikati, Yesu wa pitire mu kaci ko makanda o mahangu mu diyuwa dyo Savata. Erongwa yenthzi shime ya fire nthzara, ya tatekire ku purura mashakara o mahangu no ku a fenya no ku dya oheke. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Afarithsi ou a i monine eyo, a amberire Yesu ci: “O na mono, erongwa yoe yaa kwama enu eyi i na kana ku tawethziwa mu murao mu diyuwa dyo Savata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ene ka mwa tara eyi a kwamine Davida nowa a endireno diyuwa dimweya ou a fire nthzara? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Wengenine mu nthzio thza Nyambi, aye nowa a endireno a dire makende aa a tupweriwire Nyambi, aa a kanine ku tawethziwa ku a dya, shime mapurisita pohuma. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Nji ka mwa tara yo mu murao wa Mushe yo kuninga ci mapurisita aa thsirekanga murao o diyuwa dyo Savata mu Tembere, unone shaanga kengeyo ka di no murandu? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Naa mi tongwera, muno mwaa di o mukuru mu thsivaka kupita Tembere. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Nga mu na dimuka ku tongonona nawa eyi a amba aa maywi o kuninga ci: ‘Naa fota ñeke kadi eyambero,’ nga ka mu raturire anu o kupira murandu. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Mweyo, Mwana Munu po Fumu o diyuwa dyo Savata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa o ku ara dyoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu ou a tundire apo, wa kengenine mu sinagoge thzo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Omo mu sinagoge mwekarire mukwerume o ku ara dyoko. Awa ekariremo shime a fotire dyo ku capa Yesu eamba, ngou a mwipurire ci: “Ene yaa tawethziwa mu murao wetu ku porithsa munu mu diyuwa dyo Savata nji?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Ngeci ku kwenu kwaa di munu oyu di no dingu, nga adyopo di wera mu diteke mu diyuwa dyo Savata, ene nga ka a di kwata no ku di tundithsamo mu diyuwa dyo Savata nji? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Munu po mukuru nene mu thsivaka kupita dingu. Mweyo, murao waa tawethza ku kwama yoiwa mu diyuwa dyo Savata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Yesu ngou a amberire oya mukwerume ci: “O orore dyoko dyoe.” Ou a di ororire dya porire no kwikara nawa eci edi dimweya. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Afarithsi ngou a punine no ku ka yongora edi nga a twethsa kwipaa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mupika Nyambi oyu a hangurire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu pa ku dimuka eyi a yongorire, wa tundire muya mu ndau. Anu owangi a mu shupwerire, karo wa porithsire ku kwo wahe awa a korire. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Unone wa wa nomenithsire ci a mu yukithsa. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Eyi ya citomborire neyi a ambire Nyambi ka mukwakukethza Isaya ci:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Oyu po mupikange oyu na ni hangura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">oyu na shima no ku ni roerithsa nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">kenge na ku paka Mupepo wange pa penthzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">karo kenge a ku tongwera matunga raturo thzange.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ka a ku cikanyeka no munu nji ku kayathzoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">no diywi dyenthzi ka dya ku yuvahara mu mambanthza.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Ka a ku corerera dimbungu dyo ku funyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">nji ku thzima kambarambara aka ka monyamonya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">kenge a ku ootera kengeyo, kate owawa ou wa ku othza.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Matunga kenge a ku kurupera mu dithzina dyenthzi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Isa 42.1-4</ref>. </char> </note><verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Ñathsire o mathzimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Anu ngou a retire kwa Yesu mukwerume o mathzimu o kapuputwa karo shiamba. Yesu wa porithsire oya mukwerume, ayepo twethsa ku mona no ku amba. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Anu wahe a komokire no ku cipaura ci: “Ene oyu ne kenge nga ikara ci yodiyo Mwana Davida nji?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Afarithsi ou a i yuvire eyo, a ambire ci: “Oyu munu aa cithza mathzimu pakuninga ci Beelezebule ñathsire wao yo na mu pa okoro o ku tenda kengeyo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu wa dimukire eanekera yo, ngou a wa amberire ci: “Kutumina kokuhe ko ku citepa ko ku cirwithsa kenge kwa kwipa. Karo anu o diumbo dyofoci nji anu o mwanda ofoci o ku cirwithsa ka ku tanara. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ngeci Satana aa cicithza, apo po aa cirwithsa thsinda. Kutumina kwenthzi ne ngepi nga ku tanara? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ngeci mwaa ninga ci naa cithza mathzimu kokoro o ku ni pa Beelezebule, awa anuenu ne aa a cithza kokoro ou u tunda kupi? Nanuenu kenge a ku mi ratura. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Unone ngeci naa cithza mathzimu ko Mupepo wa Nyambi, apo honi Kutumina kwa Nyambi ku na kumu ku kwenu.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Karo ngepi edi nga a twethsa munu kwingena mu nthzio thzo munu o mukoro ci a ka shimbe etere yenthzi, o ku shime tango kwanga oya munu shokoro? Shime o ku na tende kengeyo mbeci nga a twethse ku i cishimbera.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Munu yomuhe o kukana ku nimanena aa ni rwithsa, o kukana ku ni kwathsa kungera a shandura. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Mweyo, naa mi ambera ci thsivi thsothsihe no kuyengwa kenge ya ku teteriwa, unone o ku yengwera Mupepo Oukenu, aye mbera ka a teteriwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Munu yomuhe o ku amba thsothsimango kwa Mwana Munu aa twethsa ku teteriwa, unone yomuhe o ku amba thsothsimango ku Mupepo Oukenu, mbera ka a teteriwa, ikare mo uno mwoyo nji mou mwoyo u keya.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitondo no ima yathso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Ngeci thsitondo thsiwa, no ima yathso iwa, ngeci thsimango, no ima yathso imango. Mweyo, thsitondo thsa ku dimukera ku ima yathso. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Amwe mwana mayoka, ngepi nga mu amba enu yoiwa amwe mwanu owamango? Inene mu kanwa mwa ku amba eyi ya yara mu mucima. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Kwa munu omuwa kwa ku tunda enu yoiwa yo mu thsinyungero thsenthzi thsothsiwa, karo kwa munu omumango kwa ku tunda yoimango yo mu thsinyungero thsenthzi thsothsimango. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Naa mi ambera ci: ‘Mu diyuwa dyo raturo, munu no munu kenge a ku citawera pa diywi no diywi edi naa rapoka ku amba.’ <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Maywi oe kenge a ku ku thsambwithsa nji ku ku wemeka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu aa romba thsimonithso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar 8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Afarithsi narongithsi o murao a amberire Yesu ci: “Murongithsi, twaa fota ku ku mona o ku kwama thsimonithso.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Anu o rerodino owamango no kukana ku rurama, aa romba thsimonithso, unone ka piwa thsimonithso shime thsa mukwakukethza Jonasi. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Inene dyodi ekarire Jonasi mayuwa ahatu no mathsiku ahatu mu dira dyo thsi o mukuru, no Mwana Munu naye kenge a kwikara mayuwa ahatu no mathsiku ahatu mu muve.<verse eid="MAT 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />“AkwaNinive kenge a kwimana no ku ratura anu o rerodino mu diyuwa dyo raturo, inene awo po a cerire munyima thzerongithsa ya Jonasi, pano honi o mukuru kupita Jonasi pa a di pano. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Fumu o mbuyama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyu yodiyo Fumu wa Sheba oyu na ambauriwa mu 1 Mafumu 10:1-13.</char></note> o ku mboera naye kenge a kwimana ku ratura anu o rerodino, inene wa ka tundire kokure, ku hura o kaye ku na yuva onyanyami wa Solomoni. Naa mi ambera ci o mukuru kupita Solomoni pa a di pano.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukahuka ko mupepo oumango kwa munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Mupepo oumango o ku u na tundu kwa munu waa thza mu dikunguthsitu ku fota ko ku turumwithsera, unone kamona aopo u kwanga ku wana mo ku turumwithsera, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />wa amba ci: ‘Naa huka mu nthzio thzange muya na ni tundu.’ Ngeci aopo na u thzi wana mukunguru, thzi na kombiwa no ku roithsiwa nawa, <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />waa thza no ku ka shimba mipepo thzimweya thzo mutanu na thzidi thzothzimango nene ku u pita, thzaa keya thzothzihe ku na tungamo. Ku hura oya munu kenge a kwipa kupita pa kutanga. Dyo ya kwikara ko uno mukuta oumango.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mama wa Yesu namina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu o ku ambaura no mbunga, mama wa Yesu namina Yesu wakwerume a kumine. A nemanine pora ku taterera ci a ambe nenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Munu yumweya wa mu tongwerire ci: “Njinoe naminoe pora a di, aa fota ku amba noe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Mama ne edye, naminange ne adye?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Yesu ngou a nehire erongwa yenthzi no ku amba ci: “Mu na mono, awa po wodiyo amama naminange! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Munu yomuhe o ku kwama eshima ya Tata o ku wiru, yodiyo minange o mukwerume no ndumbuthzange no mama.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mukwakukuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Mwedyo diyuwa, Yesu wa tundire mu nthzio no ku thza ku kakuro ko diviya oku a kekarire. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mukaci kongi anu awa a konganenine ku kwenthzi, wa shamukerire mu wato no ku kekaramo, anu wahe awo o kwa nemana pa dikambo. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ngou a wa rongithsire enu yoingi ko tuthsimo ci:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Njimi yumweya wa thzire ku ka kuna mbuto. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />O ku kuhera mbuto kengeyo, mbuto thzimweya thza wererire mu dikuñwa no ku diwa kwinyunyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Thzimweya thza wererire mu mawe mo kupira muve oungi. Thza menine ko wanguwangu, inene ka pekarire muve oungi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Diyuwa ou dya kambekire, shongo thza rerire no ku kukuta pakuninga ci mithzithzi ka thza henyine mu muve. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbuto thzimweya thza wererire mu makona, makona ou a kurire, a nthzongonokithsire ekuna. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Unone mbuto thzimweya thza wererire mu muve o wiro, thza menine no ku shema nawa. Thzimweya thza wanine makumi o dikumi, thzimweya makumi mutanu na dyofoci, thzimweya makumi ahatu, kupita eyi ya kuniwire.” <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Yesu ngou a ambire ci: “Oyu di no matwi o ku yuvithsa a yuve.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi na a kwamithseranga tuthsimo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Erongwa ya keyire ku kwenthzi no ku na mwipura ci: “Ine eyi o na amberanga nanu ko tuthsimo?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Amwe po na mu piwa mathsaano o ku dimukera diano dyo Kutumina ko ku Wiru, unone awo ka na piwa kengeyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Inene oyu di nethsi thsimweya kenge a ku vungithseriwa ci ekare neyi yoingi. Unone oyu na piri thsimweya kenge a ku nyangiwa shaanga ako kokapu a di nako. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Eyi ngeyi ni na amberanga ku kwo ko tuthsimo pakuninga ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">“Aa kenga, unone kadi akwa ku mona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">aa yuva, unone kadi akwa ku yuvithsithsa.<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />“Eyi yaa citombora neyi a ambire mukwakukethza Isaya kukare keyi yo ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“ ‘Ku yuva kenge mwa ku yuva, unone ka mwa ku yuvithsithsa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">Ku kenga kenge mwa ku kenga unone ka mwa ku monenena.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Inene micima thzowa anu kadi thza ku yuvithsithsa enu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">aa civuka mu matwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">no ku cithzimenena ku meho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ku yapithsa ci meho o katere a mone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">no matwi o ci katere a yuve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">no micima thzo ci katere thzi yuvithsithse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ci katere a thsiurukere ku kwange ci ni wa porithse.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Unone amwe po mu di no thsiyauthzi, inene meho enu aa mona, no matwi enu aa yuva. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci akwakukethza owangi nanu owawawa owangi a cikumbwethzire ku mona eyi mu mona, unone ka i monine, karo a fotire ku yuva eyi mu yuva, unone ka i yuvire.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tongonona kathsimo ko mukwakukuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Mu teerere honi kathsimo ko mukwakukuna eyi ka amba. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Munu yomuhe o ku yuva diywi dyo Kutumina ko ku Wiru, unone kadi wa ku di yuvithsithsa, aa cipitura no mbuto ethzi thza wererire mu dikuñwa. O Mumango aa keya no ku na tundithsa diywi mu mucima wenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Mbuto thzo ku wera mu muve o mawe po munu o ku yuva diywi no ku di tambura ko thsinyanyu, <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />unone pakuninga ci ka a di no mithzithzi, aa tanara thsikati thsothsipu, dikarara nji kunyandithsiwa mukaci ko diywi dyange yoihe i keya aa wa ko wanguwangu. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Mbuto thzo ku wera mu makona, thzaa cipitura no munu o ku yuva diywi, unone ecoyoka yo uno mwoyo netumaura yo rufumo yaa di kwangithsa ci dikare no ima. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Unone mbuto thzo ku wera mu muve o wiro, thzaa cipitura no munu o ku yuva diywi no ku di yuvithsithsa. Aa pateka no ku shema, dimweya makumi o dikumi, dimweya makumi mutanu na dyofoci, dimweya makumi ahatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko dimbya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu wa wa terire kathsimo kamweya ci: “Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci munu oyu wa kunine mbuto thzothziwa mu dikanda dyenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Unone othsiku anu wahe o kwa na rara, mukwathsithzimbo thsenthzi wa keyire no ku na kuna dimbya mu kaci ko vuroto no ku cithzera. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Vuroto ou wa kurire no ku rupura, no dimbya nadyo dya monaharire.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />“Apika oya munu a keyire no ku na mu ambera ci: ‘Ñathsire wetu, ene kadi mbuto thzothziwa thziya no kunu mu dikanda dyoe? Kupi honi oku na di tundu edi dimbya?’<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />“Aye wa tawire ci: ‘Mukwathsithzimbo naa i tende eyi.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">“Apikenthzi a mwipurire ci: ‘Ene tu ka di thzuremo diya dimbya nji?’<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />“Aye wa tawire ci: ‘Dyombo, ou mu ka thzura dimbya kenge nga mu ka thzurerera no vuroto. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Mu i thsie i kurere pofoci, shime ku ka kuma mu thsikati thso ku cora. Wangu honi na ku ambere akwakucora ci: “Mu tange ku tundithsamo dimbya mu di ange etungu, wangu mu i tumeke. Unone mu shimbe vuroto mu u pake mu thsishete thsange.” ’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko dinanda dyotata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Wa wa terire kathsimo kamweya ci: “Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci dinanda dyotata edi a kunine munu mu dikanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Shaanga ci dionye ku nanda thzothzihe, unone o ku di na mene dyaa kura kupita emena yoihe yo mu dikanda. Dyaa piruka thsitondo ku ninga ci mane nenyunyi yaa keya ku na kwamena mataratara ku mite thzathso.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko mamene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Wa wa terire karo kathsimo kamweya ci: “Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci mamene aa a na pakerera mbuyama noshunga oungi ku ruva dikende, no ku di haheka ci di tunduruke.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu shime a kwamithsangire tuthsimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mar 4.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu shime a ambire eyi yoihe ku mbunga mu tuthsimo, kwithsa eyi a ambire ko kupira ku cikwathsithsa kathsimo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Shime a tendire kengeyo ci i citombore neyi a ambire mukwakukethza yo kuninga ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Kenge na ku cikwathsithsa tuthsimo o ku ni ambano.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Kenge na ku wa ambera enu eyi ya horekiwa ku tunda apa kombiwerire kaye.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku tongonona kathsimo ko vuroto no dimbya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Yesu ngou a thsiire mbunga no kwingena mu nthzio. Erongwa yenthzi ya keyire ku kwenthzi no ku mu ambera ci: “O tu tongonwene yo kathsimo ko dimbya mu dikanda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Aye wa i tawire ci: “Mukwa ku kuna mbuto thzothziwa po Mwana Munu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Dikanda po kaye, mbuto thzothziwa po thzaemanena ana o mu Kutumina, dimbya po ana oyu o Mumango, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />mukwathsithzimbo oyu naa kunu dimbya po shamaonga. Dicora po kupwa ko kaye, akwakucora po tungeru.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />“Eci dimbya edi di thzuriwa no ku tumekiwa mu mudiro, dyo kwa kwikara pa kupwa ko kaye. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana Munu kenge a ku tuma tungeru twenthzi, ku na tundithsa mu Kutumina kwenthzi enu yoihe eyi i retera anu ku tenda thsivi, nakwa ku shwahura murao wa Nyambi wahe. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Tungeru kenge twa ku konthzera anu owamango mu mudiro mu dirungu, omu a ku direra no ku cihuma nwaeo. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Unone owawawa kenge a ku vyakima eci diyuwa mu Kutumina kwa Tata. Oyu di no matwi a yuve.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rufumo ro ku horekiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci rufumo ro ku horekiwa mu dikanda. Yoihe a ru wana munu, naye karo aa ru horeka. Ko thsinyanyu aa thza no ku ka urithsa yoihe eyi a di nayo, no ku na ura edyo dikanda.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Karo, Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci mukwamiuro oyu fota mawe oawa oakuru mu thsivaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aa mawe a ethsiwa ci mapiare.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Yoihe a wana diwe dyo kutura nene, aa thza no ku ka urithsa eyi a di nayo yoihe no ku na di ura.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko dituwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Karo, Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci dituwa dyo ku kuhera mu diviya no ku kundura ethsi thzo mishovoshovo. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />O ku di na yara ethsi, athsinda aa di kokera pa dikambo. Aekara pashi no ku hangura ethsi, thzothziwa aa thzi paka mu mayongo, thzothzimango aa thzi konthza. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Dyo ya kwikara no pa kupwa ko kaye. Tungeru kenge twa ku na tepa owamango kowa owawawa. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Owamango no ku wa konthzera mu mudiro mu dirungu, omu a ku direra no ku cihuma nwaeo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu wepurire ci: “Ene mu na yuvithsithsa eyi enu yoihe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Awo a tawire ci: “Ii, Fumu, tu na yuvithsithsa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mweyo, murongithsi o murao yomuhe o ku piruka thsirongwa thso Kutumina ko ku Wiru, aa cipitura eci thsinda thsa nthzio o ku reta enu yoipe neyi yoikurukuru ku ka tundithsa mu thsinyungero thsenthzi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kaniwa mu Nazareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu ou a manine ku wa tera tuthsimo, wa tundire muya mu ndau. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Wa hukire mu mbongi omu a kurerire, wa tatekire ku rongithsa anu mu sinagoge thzo. Anu a komokire nene, no ku cipura ci: “Oyu munu ne aa wana kupi onyanyami o ku rongithsa, nokoro o ku kwama ekomokithsa?” <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />“Ene kadi yodiyo oyu mwana muyuwi? Mama wenthzi po kadi yodiyo Madiya? Karo aminenthzi po kadi wodiyo awa a Jakovo, Josefa, Simoni na Juda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Andumbuthzenthzi wahe po kadi wodiyo awa tu na tunguno? Kupi oku na a i wana yoihe eyi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />A mu anthziperire no ku mu kana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Unone Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Mukwakukethza po aa remekiwa kokuhe, shime mu ditunga dyenthzi no mu mwanda wenthzi modiyo a kana ku mu remeka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Mweyo, ka a kwaminemo ekomokithsa yoingi, inene ka tawire ku kwenthzi.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CC, HS, CT2</para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Johani Mukwakukorovethza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Mwethso thsikati Heroda fumu o mu Galilea wa yuvire ya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Wa amberire anduthzienthzi ci: “Oyu munu aa roera kwikara Johani Mukwakukorovethza. O na pinduka kwafu ngeyi ekarera nokoro o ku kwama ekomokithsa yo kengeyo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Heroda yodiyo karo wa tuminine ci Johani a kwatiwe, angiwe no ku pakiwa mu kamenga. Eyi a i tenderire eyi po mukaci ka Herodiasi munu wa minenthzi Filipu, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />inene Johani shime a mu amberangire ci: “Murao ka u tawethzire ci o mu yeke!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Heroda wa fotire kwipaa Johani, unone shime a yapire anu, inene wahe shime mu shimbire ci mukwakukethza.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Mu diyuwa dyo thsidika thso kwerekiwa kwa Heroda, mwana Herodiasi o mbuyamaana shime a kinine ku rupara ro mbunga. Heroda wa roerire nene <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />kuninga ci mane wa mu kumbwethzire ko ku cethzera ngoro ci kenge a mu pa thsothsihe ethsi a romba. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Kokuthza komu a ka mu hongerire mama wenthzi, oyo mbuyamaana wa rombire ci: “O ni pe mo muno mutwi wa Johani Mukwakukorovethza pa dironga.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Fumu wa i cinyengire nene, unone mukaci ko ku cethzera ngoro pa meho anu awa ethsire, wa tuminine ci ku tendiwe kengeyo. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Wa tuminine ci a ka tete Johani mutwi mu kamenga. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Mutwi wa retiwire pa dironga no ku na u pa oyo mbuyamaana, aye wa u twarire kwa mama wenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Erongwa ya Johani ya thzire ku ka shimba erama yenthzi, no ku ka i vumbeka. Ngou a thzire no ku ka tongwera Yesu eyi ya tendaharire.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aekutithsa anu o 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu ou a yuvire eyi ya tendaharire, wa tundire omo mu ndau no wato, no ku thza kokumengi oku a kekarire yofoci. Unone mungi wanu ou a i yuvire a mu shupwerire no mauru ku tunderera mu mambongi. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ou a shamukire Yesu mu wato, wa monine mbunga thzothzikuru. Wa wa yuverire ñekeñeke no ku porithsa akwakukora wo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Runguro odyo diyuwa, erongwa yenthzi ya keyire ku kwenthzi no ku amba ci: “Muno po mu murundu no diyuwa di na thzi, o kature anu a thze mu maumbo ci a ka ciurere edya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Kwithsa eyi a thzera, mu wa pe edya yoyamwe.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />A mu tawire ci: “Shime makende mutanu no thsi thzidi tu di nayo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mu i ni retere kuno.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Wa amberire mbunga ci thzikare pa mwenge. Wa shimbire ao makende o mutanu no thsi thzidi, no ku diamena ku wiru ku kanderera. Wa kuyaurire ao makende no ku a pa erongwa yenthzi ci i ere anu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Wahe a dire no kwikuta. Erongwa ya yarithsire mayongo o dikumi na edi omwamwaethzi ou wa thsiarirepo. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Kowa dire kwa tariwire pohuma akwerume o ku fota kukwana 5,000, ku tundithsako ambuyama nanuke.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa enda pa meyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joh 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ko wanguwangu munyima thzeyi, Yesu wa raererire erongwa yenthzi ci i shamukere mu wato i citangethze mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya, aye o ku katura mbunga. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Yesu ou a manine ku ciraa nanu, wa thzire pa mukinya yofoci ku ka rombera. Dyo peraurire pashi o ku ka diko yofoci. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Wato o ku u ka endera kokure no dikambo, wa ndengandengithsiwire ku mañithsingi, inene shime a tambire oku dya tundererire dipepo.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ruura Yesu wa thzire kwirongwa yenthzi o ku thza o enda pa meyu. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Erongwa ou ya mu monine o ku enda pa meyu, ya yapire nene no ku kumba ko wowa ci: “Thsirumba!” <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Unone Yesu wa ambireno wangu ci: “Mu tanare micima, mwa yapa, yame!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Peturu wa tawire ci: “Fumu, ngeci yowe shemwa, o ni tumine ni keye ku koe o ku ni enda pa meyu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O keye!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Peturu ngou a shamukire mu wato no ku enda pa meyu ku thza kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Unone ou a monine mañithsingi no mupepo oukuru edi wa pepire, wa yapire nene. Wa fotire ku thzera, ngou a kumbire ci: “Fumu, o ni yoyithse!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Popo Yesu wa ororire dyoko ku mu kwata no ku mu ambera ci: “Ine eyi o tamangerera owe shopu thsitawo?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />A shamukerire mu wato momu widi wo, no mupepo wa ongire. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Erongwa ngou yekarire mu wato, ya tongamine ku manwi ku rupara rwa Yesu no ku amba ci: “Yoshemwa yowe o Mwana Nyambi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa anu mu Genesareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />A yavukire, no ku ka thsekera mu ditunga dya Genesareta. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Anu o muya mu ndau ou a dimukire Yesu, a tumithsire maywi o kukuma kwenthzi muya mu ndau thzothzihe. Anu a retire akwakukora wo ci na a wa porithse. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Anu a adikanenine Yesu ci a wa tawethze shaanga ku kwata ku munganja o thsikoveyo thsenthzi. Awa kwatireko wahe a porire.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yakwathsañuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Afarithsi amweya narongithsi o murao awa a tundire ku Yerusalema a keyire kwa Yesu no ku na mwipura ci: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Ine erongwa yoe eyi i na kanenanga ku shupwera thsithsemwa thsakuru? Inene yaa dyanga ko kukana ku ciyoa ku nyara!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Amwe ne ine eyi mu na reeranga thsiraerera thsa Nyambi no ku shupwera thsithsemwa thsenu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Inene Nyambi wa ambire ci: ‘O remeke tata woe no mama woe,’ karo wa ambire ci: ‘Munu yomuhe o ku amba yoimango kwa tata wenthzi nji kwa mama wenthzi, aa roera ku paiwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Unone amwe mwaa amba ci kwithsa omango munu ku ambera tata wenthzi nji mama wenthzi ci: ‘Ekwathsa eyi ni na roera ku mi kwathsa na ni i hangwera Nyambi.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Mweyo, mwaa monithsa ci oya munu ka a roerire ku remeka tata wenthzi [nji mama wenthzi]. Apo honi mwaa pirithsa okoro diywi dya Nyambi no ku tanarithsa thsithsemwa thsenu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Mukwakukethza Isaya wokethzire yoshemwa keyi yenu ou a ambire ci:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“ ‘Awa anu aa ni remeka ko tunwa pohuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">unone micima thzo kure thzi di nange.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kwithsa neyi a ni romberera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">inene aa rongithsa erongithsa yanu eci eraerera ya Nyambi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enu yo ku thsireka munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu ngou ethserire mbunga ku kwenthzi no ku wa ambera ci: “Mu teerere karo mu yuvithsithse. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ethsi a na di munu tumba thsi mu thsireka, unone thso ku tunda mu kanwa kenthzi thsodiyo thso ku thsireka munu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Erongwa ngou ya keyire ku kwenthzi no ku na mwipura ci: “O na dimuka ci Afarithsi a nepithsiwera ou a na yuvu eyi?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Thsimena thsothsihe ethsi a kana ku kuna Tata o ku wiru kenge thsa ku thzuriwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Mwa i twara micima, awopo atangereri o tupuputwa, karo ngeci kapuputwa a tangerera muenthzenthzi kapuputwa, momu widi wo kenge a ka wera mu diteke.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Peturu wa tawire ci: “O tu tongonwenene aka kathsimo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Epo namwe no pano tu di ka mu yuvithsithsire? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Nji ka mu dimukire ci thsothsihe thso ku thza mu kanwa thsaa thza mu dira no ku ka tunda mwirama nji? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Unone thso ku tunda mu kanwa thsaa tunderera ku mucima, eyo yodiyo nga i thsireka munu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Inene mu mucima o munu, modiyo ku tunda eanekera yoimango yo kwipaa, mirembe, ruthziho, withzi, ku pa ombangi o tumbako, no ruhopo. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Eyo yodiyo yo ku thsireka munu, uno honi ku dya ko kukana ku cihupa ku nyara tumba i thsireka munu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitawo thsa mbuyama o Mukanana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu ngou a tundire apo no ku thza mu ndau thza Tire na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mbuyama o Mukanana oyu wekarire omo mu ndau wa keyire kwa Yesu o ku kumbanga ci: “Fumu, owe Mwana Davida, o ni yuvere ñeke, mwanange o mbuyamaana o di no mupepo oumango ou u mu nyandithsa nene!”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Unone Yesu ka a mu tawire shaanga diywi dyofoci. Erongwa yenthzi ya keyire ku kwenthzi no ku na mu romba ci: “O mu cithze, aa thza o tu tendera muyoyo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Kuma na ni tumiwa pohuma kwanu a Isiraele awa a na cipitura eci mangu o ku yonga.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Unone oya mbuyama, wa keyire no ku na wera ku mauru a Yesu no ku amba ci: “Fumu, o ni kwathse!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ka i roerire ku shimba edya yanuke ku i konthzera mbwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Aye wa tawire ci: “Fumu, eyo po ya shemwa. Unone shaanga mbwa thzaa dyanga omwamwaethzi ou u na wanga pa tafure thza hekudya thzo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yesu ngou a mu tawire ci: “O di no thsitawo thsothsikuru owe o mbuyama! Eyi o na foto kenge i tendahara ku koe.” Popo mwanenthzi wa porire.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa anu owangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu ou a tundire apo wa kurithsire Diviya dya Galilea, wa ka thzinine pa mukinya no ku kekarapo. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Anu owangi a keyire ku kwenthzi, a retire anu o kukana ku twethsa ku enda, tupuputwa, ekunga, ashiamba nakwakukora owangi, a na wa pakire ku mauru a Yesu, aye wa wa porithsire. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Anu a komokire nene ou a monine ashiamba o kwa amba, erema o ku i pora, ekunga o ku i enda nawa no tupuputwa o ku tu mona, a shangarire Nyambi wa Isiraele.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aekutithsa anu ro muthsidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu wethsire erongwa yenthzi no ku amba ci: “Ethzo mbunga naa thzi yuvera ñekeñeke, inene a na shimbi mayuwa ahatu o kwa di nange, karo ka di neyi yo ku dya, ka ni fotire ku wa huthsa ko kukana tango ku wa pa yo ku dya, inene kenge nga a pwererera mu dikuñwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Erongwa ya mwipurire ci: “Kupi nga tu wana edya yo ku pa mbunga thzothzikuru kenge muno mu murundu?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu wa ipurire ci: “Makende angashi mu di nao?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Ya tawire ci: “Makende mutanu na edi no tuthsi totupu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yesu ngou a amberire mbunga ci thzikare pashi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Wa shimbire ao makende o mutanu na edi noto tuthsi no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi, wa kuyaurire makende no ku cothzaura oto tuthsi no ku i pa erongwa yenthzi, ayo no ku i era anu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Wahe a dire no kwikuta. Erongwa ya yarithsire mayongo o mutanu na edi edya eyi ya thsiarirepo. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Taro thzowa a dire nedi akwerume o 4,000 ko kukana ku tarako ambuyama nanuke. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ngou honi Yesu a amberire mbunga ci thzi thze ku maumbo o. Aye no ku yomama mu wato no ku yavuka ku thza mu ditunga dya Magadana.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="rem">LK, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Afarithsi nAsaduki aa romba thsimonithso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Afarithsi nAsaduki a keyire kwa Yesu no ku na mu ereka ko ku mu romba ci a wa monithse thsimonithso thso ku tunda ku wiru.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Aye wa wa tawire ci: “Diyuwa o ku di ka toka mwaa amba ci: ‘Peunthza kenge kwa kwikara nawa, inene diwiru di na kihi.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Mathsikuthsiku mwaa amba ci: ‘Rero mvura kenge a roka, inene diwiru di na kihi karo ku na yambayambera.’ Mwaa twethsa ku nangura yo mikarero thzo diwiru ko ku kenga pohuma ku wiru, unone mwaa kwanga ku nangura yemonithso yekati. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Amwe mwanu o rerodino owamango no kukana ku rurama, mwaa romba thsimonithso thso ku komokithsa, ka mu thsi piwa shime thsimonithso thsa mukwakukethza Jonasi.” Popo Yesu wa wa thsiire ayepo cithzera.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamene Afarithsi nAsaduki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Erongwa ou ya yavukire ku thza mu thsambwadiya thzo diviya, ya vuramine ku shimba ñuta. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Mu mamere, mu tunde ku mamene Afarithsi nAsaduki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Erongwa ya ciyongorire mu kaci kayo, no ku amba ci: “Eyi a na i ambera iya Yesu po pakuninga ci ka tu shimbire ñuta.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu wa dimukire eyi ya ambaurire, ngou a ipurire ci: “Mwaa ambera ine keyi yo kupira ñuta, amwe mwashopu thsitawo? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Epo no thsino thsikati kadi mwakwa ku yuvithsithsa? Ka mu vurukire uya na kuyawerire anu o 5,000 makende o mutanu? Mayongo angashi mwa yarithsire oyi ya thsiarirepo? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Nji uya nekutithsire waya o 4,000 ko makende o mutanu na edi, mayongo angashi mwa yarithsire oyi ya thsiarirepo? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Ine mu na kana ku dimukerapo ci ka ni ambire yo ñuta? Mu mamere mamene Afarithsi nAsaduki.” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Erongwa honi ngou ya dimukerire ci Yesu ka a ambire yo ku cinyunga ku mamene o ku kwamithsa edya, unone kwirongithsa yAfarithsi nAsaduki.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa hokora Yesu ci yodiyo Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu ou a kumine mu ditunga dya Sesarea Filipi, wepurire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Ene anu ne aa ninga ci Mwana Munu ne yodiyo edye?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />A mu tawire ci: “Amweya aa ninga ci Johani Mukwakukorovethza, amweya ci Eliya, amweya karo ci Jeremia, nji ci yumweya wakwakukethza.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu wa ipurire ci: “Amwe honi ne mwaa ninga ci yame nodye?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Peturu wa tawire ci: “Yowe o Mesiya, Mwana Nyambi oyu yoya.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu ngou a mu amberire ci: “Simoni mwana Jonasi, o mukwa thsiyauthzi shemwa, inene kadi munu na i ku hokwera eyi, unone Tata o ku wiru yo na i ku hokwera. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Ame naa ku ambera ci yowe o Peturu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku amba ci diwe.</char></note> karo podi diwe po na ku umbera kereke thzange. Shaanga okoro o dihere ka wa ku twethsa ku thzi popwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Kenge na ku ku pa mapao o Kutumina ko ku Wiru, ethsi wa kwanga pano pashi no ku wiru kenge thsa kwangiwa, ethsi wa ku putura pano pashi no ku wiru kenge thsa ku puturiwa.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Ngou a nomenithsire erongwa yenthzi ci katere ya ku i tongwere munu ci yodiyo Mesiya.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa tongora yo kufa no kupinduka kwenthzi kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mar 8.31—9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Ku tunda ethso thsikati, Yesu wa tatekire ku tongwera erongwa yenthzi thsitonwameho ci aa roera ku thza ku Yerusalema ci a ka nyandithsiwe nene kwakuru o mbunga, nakuru o mapurisita, mofoci kengeyo narongithsi o murao. Kenge a ku ka paiwa, unone mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu kenge a ku pinduka kwafu.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Peturu ngou a mwithserire ku mbadi no ku tateka ku mu kuturura ci: “Ñathsire wange, Nyambi a tawethza enu yo kengeyo ci i tendahare ku koe!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Unone Yesu wa cithsetukire no ku ambera Peturu ci: “O tunde ku kwange Satana! O thsiparaka mu dikuñwa dyange, eanekera yoe po yonu, kadi ya Nyambi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Yesu ngou a amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Ngeci munu aa fota ku ni shupwera, aa roera ku cishuva thsinda no ku shimba mbinda thzenthzi ku ni shupwera. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Inene munu yomuhe o ku fota ku nyunga mwoyo wenthzi kenge a ku u yawa, o ku yawa mwoyo wenthzi mukaci kange kenge a ku u wana. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ine nga i kwathsa munu shaanga yo fuma kaye kokahe, unone aa yawa mwoyo wenthzi? Nji thsine nga a punithsa munu ci a wane mwoyo wenthzi? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Inene Mwana Munu kenge a ku keya mu kutethzima kwa Tata wenthzi no tungeru twenthzi. Kenge a ku na pa muyambo munu no munu kokuthza keyi naa tende. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci amweya awa a di muno ka ku fa o kwa shime ku mona Mwana Munu o ku keya mu Kutumina kwenthzi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa piruka no ku monahara kutethzima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Munyima thzo mayuwa mutanu na dyofoci, Yesu wa shimbire Peturu na Jakovo no Johani mina Jakovo, no ku wa twara pa mukinya oure apa a kekarire wafoci. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Yesu wa ka pirukire thsihanga pa meho o, rupara rwenthzi rwa tethzimine eci diyuwa neto yenthzi ya rwethzimine eci mwethzi. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Popo Mushe na Eliya a hokokire kukwo no ku ambaura na Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Peturu ngou a amberire Yesu ci: “Fumu, i na roo eyi tu di kuno. Ngeci o na i shimi, kenge ni kwama matunu ahatu, dimweya dyoe, dimweya dya Mushe, dimweya dya Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />O ku amba kengeyo kwa keyire divui dyo kutethzima edi dya wa thsikire. Diywi dya ambire ku tunderera omo mu divui ci: “Oyu po Mwanange oyu na shima no ku ni roerithsa nene. Mu mu yuvere.”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus is transfigured before Peter, James and John" file="gt00032.tif" size="col" loc="Mat 17:1-8" copy="Gordon" ref="17.1-8">Yesu aa piruka pa meho a Peturu, Jakovo na Johani</figure><verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Erongwa ou ya yuvire eyi ya yapire nene no ku wa pashi ku furumana. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Unone Yesu wa keyire kukwo, wa i kwatire no ku amba ci: “Mu kotoke mwa yapa.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ou ya kotokire no ku kenga, kwithsa munu oyu ya monine shime Yesu pohuma.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />O kwa urumuka ku tunda pa mukinya, Yesu wa wa raererire ci: “Mwa ku i tongwera munu eyi mu na mono shime Mwana Munu ou a ku pinduka kwafu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Erongwa ngou ya mwipurire ci: “Ine eyi a na amberanga arongithsi o murao ci Eliya yo na roera kutanga ku keya?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Yoshemwa Eliya aa roera ku tanga ku keya ku na roithsa enu yoihe. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Unone naa mi tongwera ci Eliya naa keya kare, unone anu ka na mu dimuka, na mu tende omu na shimena momuhe. No Mwana Munu naye dya ku mu nyandithsa kengeyo.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Erongwa ngou ya yuvithsithsire ci Yesu shime a ambire ya Johani Mukwakukorovethza.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa mukwerumeana o mupepo oumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9.37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Yesu neyo erongwa yenthzi ou a hukire ku mbunga, kwa keyire mukwerume no ku na tongama ku manwi ku mauru a Yesu no ku amba ci: <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Fumu, o fere ñeke mwanange wa thsinyonya. Thsaa mu nyandithsanga nene, inene thsaa mu withseranga rorungi mu mudiro no mu meyu. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ni na mu reta kwirongwa yoe, unone a na kwanga ku mu porithsa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Amwe mwanu owamango no kupira thsitawo! Thsikati thso ku kuma kupi ni na roera kwikara nenu? Diyuwa dipi na ku mi kunda? Mu mu rete kuno oyo mwanuke.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu wa tuminine oo muthzimu ci u mu tunde. Wa mu tundire, no mwanuke popo wa porire.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Erongwa ya keyire kwa Yesu ku mukunda no ku mwipura ci: “Ine eyi tu na kwangera ku cithza uya mupepo oumango?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Wa tawire ci: “Mukaci ko thsitawo thsenu opu. Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci nga mu di no thsitawo thso ku kuma pa dinanda dyotata, kenge nga mu twethsa ku ambera ou mukinya ci: ‘O tuturuke apo o thze paya,’ kenge nga u thza karo kwithsa ethsi nga thsi kanga ku kwenu. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />[Shime ko thsirombero no ku cikanga no nthzara nga mu twethsa ku cithza mupepo o kengeya. Ko kupira eyo, tumba i tawa.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba karo yo kufa no ku pinduka kwenthzi kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9.43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Diyuwa dimweya erongwa ou ya ciwanawanine mu Galilea, Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Mwana Munu a tamba ku mu pa mu moko anu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Awo kenge a ku mwipaa, unone kenge a ku pinduka kwafu mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu.” Erongwa ya i cinyengire nene.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutero o Tembere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi ou a kumine mu Kapenauma, aterithsi o mutero o Tembere a keyire kwa Peturu no ku na mwipura ci: “Ene murongithsi wenu ne ka a terangire mutero o Tembere nji?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Peturu wa tawire ci: “Dyombo, aa teranga.” Peturu wengenine mu nthzio. Unone o ku shime no kuninga ci a ambe, Yesu wa mwipurire ci: “Simoni, owe ne waa mona ngepi? Ene mafumu o kaye ne aa terithsanga ano nji, inji anuawo?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Peturu wa tawire ci: “Anuawo.” Yesu wa ambire ci: “I na roo, ano ka terangire. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Uno honi ka tu fotire ku wepithsera. O thze ku diviya o ka rovere, mu kanwa ko thsi oyu o ka tanga ku njambura kenge o ka wanamo madi o muwayawaya o silivera. O ka a shimbe o ka tere mutero wetu twaidi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">O mukuru ne edye?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Kethsiya thsikati erongwa ya keyire kwa Yesu no ku mwipura ci: “Edye o mukuru nene mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu wethsire kanuke no ku kemeka mu kaciko. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Wa ambire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ngeci ka mwa ku piruka kwikara eci twanuke, mbera ka mwingena mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Mweyo, yomuhe o ku cihuthsa kushi eci aka kanuke yo mukuru nene mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Yomuhe o ku tambura kanuke eci aka mu dithzina dyange yame a na tambura.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etumaura yo ku twara ku thsivi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Unone yomuhe o ku retera yumweya kowa owaonye awa na tawa ku kwange ci a tende thsivi, ku di nawa ci nga a angereriwa diwe dyodikuru mu thsingo no ku konthzeriwa mu diwate. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Kaye ka di nothsimo mukaci keyi i dimo eyi i retera anu ci a tende thsivi. Etumaura kenge ikarangako thsikati thsothsihe, unone o di nothsimo mukwa ku i reta!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Mweyo, ngeci dyoko dyoe nji thsidyato thsoe yaa ku twara ku thsivi, i teteko no ku i konthza. Ku di nawa ci o wingene mu mwoyo o ku di thsirema nji thsikunga kupita kwikara no moko edi nji edyato idi, unone waa konthzeriwa mu mudiro o diyere. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Karo ngeci dithziho dyoe dyaa ku twara ku thsivi, o dithzongoremo no ku di konthza. Ku di nawa ci o wingene mu mwoyo no dithziho dyofoci kupita ku konthzeriwa mu mudiro o dihere no meho edi.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko dingu dyo ku yonga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Mu mamere ci mwa shwahurapo yumweya powa owaonye. Naa mi ambera yoshemwa ci tungeru two mu wiru pa meho a Tata tu di thsikati thsothsihe. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />[Inene Mwana Munu aa keyera ku na yoyithsa awa na yongo.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="Parable of the lost sheep" file="dn00473b.tif" size="col" loc="Mat18:12-14" copy="Dunham" ref="18.12-14">Kathsimo ko dingu dyo ku yonga</figure><verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mwaa anekera ngepi? Ngeci munu o di no mangu o makumi dikumi, apopo pa yonga dyofoci, ine nga a tenda oya munu? Ene nga ka a thsii ao o 99 o ku a dyera ku nganga thzo mukinya no ku ka fota edi di na yongopo nji? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ngeci ayepo ka di wana, naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kenge a di nyanyukera nene kupita ao o 99 aa a na kana ku yonga! <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Mofoci, kadi eshima ya Tata o mu wiru ci pa yonge shaanga yofoci powa owaonye.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O ku na kwipithsera muenthzoe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Ngeci muenthzoe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diywi dyo Thsigerike dyaa amba ci mukwakutawa yumweya o mukwerume nji o mbuyama.</char></note> ayepo kwipithsera, o mu thzere o ka mu ambere ku mukunda eyi a nepithsa. Ngeci ayepo ku yuvera, o na mu kwathsa. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ngeci ayepo kana ku ku yuvera, o shimbeko yofoci nji aidi ku thza noe ku kwenthzi, ci eyi o ka amba i ka tanarere pa mambangi edi nji ahatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Murao 19.15.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Ngeci ayepo kana ku wa yuva, o ka i tongore ku kereke. Ngeci ayepo kana ku yuvera kereke, o mu shimbe eci Munukenge nji eci muterithsi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yoihe eyi mwa kwanga pano pashi, no mu wiru kenge ya kwangiwa; karo yoihe eyi mwa ku putura pano pashi, kenge ya ku puturiwa no mu wiru.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Naa mi ambera karo ci ngeci anu aidi ku kwenu awopo a ciyuva ku romberera thsinu pano pashi, Tata mu wiru kenge a ku thsi wa tendera. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Inene anu aidi nji ahatu yoihe a ciwana pofoci mu dithzina dyange, name mu kaciko ni di.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko ngamba o kukana ku tetera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Peturu wa keyire kwa Yesu no ku mwipura ci: “Fumu, miendo thzingashi ni na roera ku tetera muenthzange o ku ni pithseranga. Miendo mutanu na thzidi nji?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Dyombo, kadi miendo mutanu na thzidi, unone miendo thzo makumi mutanu na edi ku thzi taimithsa ko mutanu na thzidi.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Mweyo, Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci fumu oyu wa anekerire ku tatufa mavuka o madi kwangambenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ou a tatekire ku tatufa, a mu reterire mukwamakongo oyu wa mu koroterire madi oangi nene. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Pakuninga ci ka a twethsire ku futura ao makongo, ñathsire wenthzi wa tuminine ci oyo munu a urithsiwe mofoci kengeyo na munuwenthzi, nanenthzi netere yenthzi yoihe ci a kure ao makongo.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />“Unone oyo ngamba wa tongamine ku manwi no ku adikanena ñathsire wenthzi ci: ‘O nimaneneko, kenge na ku futura oahe ao makongo.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Ñathsire wenthzi wa mu yuverire ñekeñeke, wa mu teterire murandu wenthzi no ku mu thsia ci a thze.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Unone ou a thsiire ñathsire wenthzi, oya ngamba wa wanine yumweya kwaenthzenthzi angamba oyu wa mu koroterire madi oapu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike aa ñorapo dinari, madi o muhorero o mu diyuwa dyofoci. </char></note> Wa mu kwatire no ku mu ngama pa mudyu no ku amba ci: ‘O future makongo ange.’<verse eid="MAT 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />“Oyo muenthzenthzi ngamba wa tongamine ku manwi no ku mu adikanena ci: ‘O nimaneneko, kenge na ku futura makongo oe.’<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />“Unone aye wa kanine, wa mwangithsire no ku mu paka mu kamenga shime apa mba a futwera makongo oahe. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Aenthzenthzi angamba ou a monine eyi ya tendaharire, a i cinyengire nene. A thzire kwa ñathsire wo no ku ka mu tongwera yoihe eyi ya tendaharire.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />“Ñathsire wenthzi ngou a mwithsire no ku mu ambera ci: ‘Owe ngamba omumango, na ni ku tetera aya makongo ange pakuninga ci shime waa ni adikanena. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Shime no roera ku fera ñeke muenthzoe ngamba eci diya na ni ku fera ñeke nowe.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Ñathsire wenthzi wa anthzipire nene, ngou a mu tumithsire ku kamenga ci a ka humbithsiwe shime ou mba a futura makongo enthzi oahe.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yesu wa shumunine ku amba ci: “Tata oyu di ku wiru kenge mba a mi tenda kengeyo ngeci kadi mwakwa ku tetera aenthzenu ku tunderera ku micima thzenu shemwa.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo kufa ko maruo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu ou a manine ku amba eyo, wa tundire mu Galilea no ku thza mu ditunga dya Judea mu thsambwadiya thzo Rware rwa Jorodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Mbunga thzothzikuru thza mu shupwerireko, wa ka porithsire awa a korire.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Afarithsi amweya a keyire no ku na mu ereka. A mwipurire ci: “Ene mukwerume ne aa tawethziwa ku rukurura munuwenthzi pa ngara thsinu nji?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ene ka mwa tara eyi i na ñoriwa mu Mañoro ci ku matatekero ‘Nyambi shime ombire mukwerume no mbuyama nji?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Ngou a ambire ci: ‘Mukwerume kenge mba a thsia tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi no ku cikwata na munuwenthzi, karo awo aidi kenge mba piruka thsirama thsofoci.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Apo honi kadi anu aidi karo, unone a na piruka thsirama thsofoci. Mweyo, ethsi a na waneka Nyambi, munu a thsi tepa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Afarithsi ngou epurire Yesu ci: “Mushe honi ne ine eyi a raererire mukwerume ku pa diñoro munuwenthzi dyo ku mu rukurura no ku mu kondora?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Mushe shime a mi tawethzire ku rukurura anuwenu mukaci kokaru o micima thzenu, unone ku matatekero Nyambi ka a i pakire kengeyo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Naa mi ambera ci mukwerume yomuhe o ku rukurura munuwenthzi no ku yeka wao na rembeka, shime ngeci aa mu rukurwera yo mirembe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Erongwa yenthzi ya mu amberire ci: “Ngeci dyo i di kengeyo mu kaci ka mukwerume na munuwenthzi, kandi ku di nawa honi ne kukana ku yeka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Eyo po kadi cingwa ya munu yomuhe, shime awa naa i pa Nyambi. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Inene amweya aa kwanga ku yeka mukaci ko ku ninga ci dyerekiwire, amweya aa kwanga ku yeka mukaci ko ku i wa kwama anu. Amweya aa cihangwera kukana ku yeka mukaci ko Kutumina ko ku Wiru. O ku twethsa ku tambura eyi erongithsa a i tambure.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa fiyawera anuke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Diyuwa dimweya anu a retire twanuke kwa Yesu ci a tu kambeke moko no ku tu romberera. Unone erongwa ya wa kutururire.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus blesses little children" file="dn00413b.tif" size="col" loc="Mat 19:13-15" copy="Dunham" ref="19.13-15">Yesu aa fiyawera twanuke</figure><verse eid="MAT 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Mu thsie twanuke tu keye ku kwange, mwa tu kanithsa, inene Kutumina ko ku Wiru po kwanu o kwikara eci ato.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Yesu wa tu kambekire moko, ou a manine wa thzire.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mushumba o fumanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Munu yumweya wa keyire kwa Yesu ku na mwipura ci: “Murongithsi, enu mwine yoiwa eyi ni na roera ku kwama ci nga ni wane mwoyo o diyere?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Waa nipwera ine keyi yoiwa? O muwa po yofoci pohuma. O hengeke eraerera ngeci waa fota kwingena mu mwoyo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Aye wepurire ci: “Eraerera ipi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “ ‘Kadi o mukwa kwipaa, kadi o mukwa ku rembeka, kadi o mukwa kwithza, kadi o mukwa ku pa ombangi o tumbako. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />O remeke tata woe no mama woe,’ karo ‘o shime muenthzoe eci edi wa cishima othsinda.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Oyo mushumba wa tawire ci: “Na i hengeka yoihe eyo eraerera. Ine karo eyi ni na roera ku kwama?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “Ngeci waa fota kwikara o kwononoka, o thze o ka urithse eyi o di nayo yoihe, madi o a pe ahepwe, wangu wa kwikare no rufumo mu wiru. Ku tunda apo o ni shupwere.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Oyo mushumba ou a yuvire eyo wa thzire o ku na cinyenge nene pakuninga ci shime a fumine nene. <verse eid="MAT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yesu ngou a amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ku karu nene fumanyi kwingena mu Kutumina ko ku Wiru. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Karo naa shumuna ku mi ambera kenge ci kenge nga iotopa ci kamere engene mu dithziho dyo thsonga, kupita ci fumanyi engene mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Erongwa ou ya i yuvire ya komokire nene no ku amba ci: “Edye ne honi mbo yoyithsiwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu wa i kengererire no ku amba ci: “Kwanu po tumba i tawa, unone kwa Nyambi po enu yoihe yaa tawa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Peturu wa mu amberire ci: “O na mono, atwe tu na thsii enu yetu yoihe no ku ku shupwera, ine eyi twa ku wana?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci mu kaye kokape, Mwana Munu ou mba ekara mu ngunja thzenthzi thzo kutethzima, namwe amwe mu na ni shupwera kenge mba mwikara mu mangunja o dikumi na edi, ku ratura mikuta thzo dikumi na thzidi thza Isiraele. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Wahe awa na thsii manthzio, akurwo namino, atata wo namama wo, nano, nji makanda mukaci kange, kenge a ku wana ñambeko thzo makumi o dikumi peuru, ku hura a ku wane no mwoyo o diyere. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Unone owangi awa a di ku rupara kethsino thsikati kenge a kwikara ku manyima, awa a di ku manyima kenge a kwikara ku rupara.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kakwakukwama mu dikanda dyo veine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci thsinda thsa dikanda oyu wa menekerire ku ka fota anu o ku na kwama mu dikanda dyenthzi dyo veine. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Wa ciyuvireno ku wa horithsa madi o muhorero o diyuwa dyofoci, ngou a wa tumithsire ku ka kwama mu dikanda dyenthzi dyo veine.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />“Wa thzire karo ku maurithsero ko thsikati thso 9, wa ka monine akwerume amweya awa a cikarerire kwithsa yo ku kwama. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Wa wa amberire ci: ‘Mu thze namwe mu ka kwame mu dikanda dyange dyo veine, kenge ni mi horithsa omu ku na roera.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Nawo a thzire ku ka kwama. Wa thzire karo mu thsikati thso mutenya no ku di na thsiuruka diyuwa o ku tendanga kengeyo. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Runguro wa hukire ku maurithsero, wa ka wanine karo amweya awa cikarerire. Ngou a wepurire ci: ‘Ine eyi mu na cikarerera kengeyo diyuwa mutumbi kwithsa thso ku kwama?’<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />“Awo a tawire ci: ‘Kwithsa oyu na tu pa ekwama.’ Wa wa amberire ci: ‘Mu thze namwe mu ka kwame mu dikanda dyange dyo veine.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Kanguronguro, thsinda thsa dikanda dyo veine wa amberire muendithsi wekwama yenthzi ci: ‘O withse akwakukwama wahe no wa horithse madi o, o tatekere waya o mahurerero, no ku manenena ko waya o kutanga.’<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />“Ou a kumine awa engenine pekwama runguro, munu no munu wa horire madi o muhorero o diyuwa dyofoci. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Awa a tangire pekwama ou a keyire ku kuhora, a anekerire ci kenge a hora madi oangi kupita awa engenine munyima. Unone nawo a horire madi o muhorero o diyuwa dyofoci. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />A shimbire madi o no ku tateka ku cithsimoka kwa thsinda thsa dikanda. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />A ambire ci: ‘Awa a nengena pekwama ku mahurerero a na kwama thsitunde thsofoci, unone atwe tu na kwama diyuwa mutumbi o ku tu pya mutenya, uno honi o na wa pa madi mofoci eci atwe.’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Unone aye wa tawire yumweya ku kwo ci: ‘O na yuvu shadi, ka ni mipithserire, shime tu na ciyuvu madi o muhorero o diyuwa dyofoci. <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />O shimbe madi oe o thze ku diumbo. Dyo i na i shimi ku pa o mahurerero madi eci aa ni na ku pa. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ene ka ni tawethziwire ku tenda omu ni na shimena pa madi ange? Nji waa ni tendera mbamba pa kupa kwange?’<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />“Mweyo, o mamaneneno kenge a kwikara o kutanga, karo o kutanga kenge a kwikara o mamaneneno.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba karo yo kufa no ku pinduka kwenthzi kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu o ku di mu dikuñwa dyo ku thza ku Yerusalema, wa shimbire erongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi ku thzano kokumengi no ku ka wa ambera ci: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Mu teerere, twaa thza ku Yerusalema oko Mwana Munu a ku ka piwa kwakuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao. Kenge a ku ka mu ratwera kufa. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Kenge a ku ka piwa mu moko Anukenge awa a ku mu varaera, ku mu fura no ku mwamba pa mbinda, unone kenge a ku pinduriwa kwafu mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiromba thsa mama wa Jakovo na Johani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Mama wa Jakovo na Johani, ana Zebedea, ngou a keyire kwa Yesu nanenthzi aidi wakwerume, wa na tongamine ku manwi pa rupara rwenthzi no ku romba ci a mu tende nawa.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu wa mwipurire ci: “Ine eyi o fota?” Aye wa mu tawire ci: “O ni kumbwethze ci awa anange, momu widi wo ci a kwikare yumweya ku rudyo rwoe, yumweya ku rumoho rwoe mu Kutumina koe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Ka mu dimuka ethsi mu romba. Ene kenge nga mu twethsa ku nwena mu nganja thzo makando ethzi na ku nwena nji?” A mu tawire ci: “Twaa twethsa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Yoshemwa kenge mwa ku nwena mu nganja thzange, uno honi yo kwikara ku rudyo nji ku rumoho rwange po kadi cingwa yame na ku i fungura. Ao mandau po a ku piwa kowa naa a roithsera Tata.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Erongwa yo dikumi ou ya yuvire eyo, ya anthziperire Jakovo na minenthzi Johani. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yesu ngou a ithserire yoihe pofoci no ku i ambera ci: “Mu na dimuka ci aendithsi wAnukenge po a di nokoro peuru thzowa a na endithsa, karo nowa a di neturo yoshokuru a di nokoro o ku wa endithsa omu a na shimena. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Unone ya dikara kengeyo mu kaci kenu, oyu na foto kwikara o mukuru mu kaci kenu a piruke ngamba wenu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Oyu na foto kwikara o kutanga a piruke mupikenu, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />eci Mwana Munu edi na a kana ku keyera ci anu a mu kwamene, unone aa keyera ku na kwamena anu no ku shuva mwoyo wenthzi kwikara thsipaturithso thsanu owangi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa porithsa akwerume aidi o tupuputwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu nerongwa yenthzi ou a tundire ku Jeriko, anu owangi a mu shupwerire. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Anu aidi o tupuputwa ekarire ku mbadi thzo dikuñwa. Ou a yuvire ci Yesu aa pita, a kumbire ci: “Fumu, Mwana Davida, o tu yuvere ñeke!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Mbunga thza wa kutururire ci a tutware, unone awo a kumbire nene ku amba ci: “Fumu, Mwana Davida, o tu yuvere ñeke!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu wemanine, wa wethsire no ku na wepura ci: “Mwaa fota ci ni mi kwamene ine?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />A tawire ci: “Fumu, twaa fota ku mona.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu wa wa yuverire ñekeñeke, ngou a wa kwatire pa meho. Popo a monine, awopo a mu shupwera.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="rem">LK, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aengena mu Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />O kwa kokera ku Yerusalema, a kumine mu diumbo dya Betifage, pa mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera. Podiyo a tumenine Yesu idi kwirongwa yenthzi, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />no ku i ambera ci: “Mu thze mu diumbo edi di di pa rupara rwenu, kenge mu ka wana thsindongi ethsi thsi na fungereriwa no mwanathso ku mbadi, mu ka i puture, mu ka i ni retere kuno. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ngeci waa ka mipure munu, mu ka mu ambere ci: ‘Fumu na i foto,’ popo kenge a ka mi tawethza ku i shimba.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Eyi shime ya tendaharire ci i citombore neyi a ambire mukwakukethza ci:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Mu tongwere mbongi thza Sione ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">O mone, Fumu woe aa keya ku koe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">na cihuthsa kushi, na pahama pa thsindongiana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">mwana thsindongi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Erongwa ya thzire no ku ka tenda dyodi a i tongwerire Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Ya ka retire thsindongi no mwana thso, a na yarirepo ekoveyo yo, Yesu ayepo pahamapo. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mbunga thza yarire ekoveyo yo mu dikuñwa, amweya a ka tetire mite thzetondo ku na yara mu dikuñwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Anu amweya awa endire ku rupara no ku nyima thza Yesu a tatekire ku kuerera ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku shangariwe. </char></note> Mwana Davida!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">‘Wa thsiyauthzi oyu keya mu dithzina dya Fumu!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Hosana mu diwiru!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu ou engenine mu Yerusalema, thsikuña thsothsihe thsemanine shakashaka no kwipura ci: “Edye oyu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Mbunga thza tawire ci: “Yodiyo Yesu mukwakukethza o ku Nazareta mu ditunga dya Galilea.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kanithsa ku urithsera mu Tembere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu ou engenine mu Tembere wa cithzacithziremo awa a urire no ku urithseramo. Wa huwire matafure owa cinjire madi no ku huwa epura yowa a urithsire mayembe. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Ngou a wa amberire ci: “Ku na ñoriwa ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:13">“ ‘Nthzio thzange kenge mbo thzithsiwa nthzio thzerombero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:13">unone amwe na mu thzi pirura macihoreko ethzi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Tupuputwa nekunga a keyire kwa Yesu mu Tembere, aye wa wa porithsire. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Akuru o mapurisita narongithsi o murao a anthzipire ou a monine ekomokithsa eyi a kwamine, nanuke awa a kuererire mu Tembere ci: “Hosana Mwana Davida!”<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ngou epurire Yesu ci: “O na yuvu eyi a amba awa anuke?” Aye wa wa tawire ci: “Ni na i ciyuvera nawanawa. Ene ka mwa tara eyi ya ñoriwire yo ku ninga ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">“‘No rongithsa anuke no tumbu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">ku ku shangara’?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Yesu ngou a wa thsiire ku tunda mu Yerusalema ku thza ku Betania oku a ka rarire.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kuta thsitondo thsokuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar 11.12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Diyuwa edi dya randireko, Yesu o ku huka ku Yerusalema wa fire nthzara. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Wa monine thsitondo thsokuyu ku mbadi thzo dikuñwa. Wa thzire ku ka fotako ñuyu, unone ka a ka wanineko thsimweya shime mamuna pohuma. Ngou a amberire oo okuyu ci: “Owe o thsitondo mbera wema karo!” Popo ethso thsitondo thsa waukire.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Erongwa ou ya i monine eyo, ya komokire. Yepurire ci: “Ngepi u na wauka wangu ou okuyu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu wa i tawire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kamona mu tawa no kukana ku tamangera, mwaa twethsa ku tenda eyi ni na tende kothsi thsitondo thsokuyu. Kadi eyo pohuma, unone kenge nga mu twethsa ku ambera nou mukinya ci: ‘O thzuruke ka cikonthzere mu diwate,’ kenge nga i dikara. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Kamona mu tawa kenge mwa ku tambura yoihe eyi mwa ku romba ko thsirombero.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aepuriwa pokoro wenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu ou engenine mu Tembere, o ku rongithsa, akuru o mapurisita nakuru o Majuda a keyire ku kwenthzi ku na mwipura ci: “Ou okoro o kwamithsa eyi ne waa tunda kupi?” “Karo oyu na a u ku pa ne edye?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Name tango ni mipure ngudi thzofoci pohuma, ngeci o mu thzi ni tawe name kenge ni mi tongwera oku u tunda ou okoro ni kwamithsa eyi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Johani ne kupi a wanine okoro o ku korovethza, ku wiru nji kwanu?” A i ciyongorire mu kaciko ci: “Ngeci o tu ninge ci: ‘Ku wiru,’ kenge a twipura ci: ‘Ine honi na mu kana ku tawa yenthzi?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Karo ngeci o tu ninge ci: ‘Kwanu,’ twaa yapa mbunga, inene wahe aa tawa ci Johani po mukwakukethza.”<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ngou a tawire Yesu ci: “Ka tu dimuka.” Yesu naye wa wa amberire ci: “Name ka ni mi tongwera oku u tunda ou okoro ni kwamithsa eyi enu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kana aidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Mwaa anekera ngepi? Kwekarire munu oyu wekarire nana aidi wakwerume. Wa thzire koyu o kutanga no ku ka mu ambera ci: ‘Mwanange, o thze o ka kwame ku dikanda dyo veine rero.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Mwanamunu wa kanine ci: ‘Ka ni fotire,’ unone munyima wa pirurire eanekera yenthzi no ku thza. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Tatawamunu wa thzire koyu yumweya no ku ka mu ambera maywi o ku cipitura. Aye wa tawire ci: ‘Naa thza tata,’ unone ka a thzireko.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />“Edye powa aidi oyu wa kwamine eshima ya tata wenthzi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">A tawire ci: “O kutanga.” Yesu wa ambire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci aterithsi nambuyama o maherehere wa kwikara ku rupara rwenu kwingena mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Inene Johani Mukwakukorovethza wa keyire ku na mi monithsa dikuñwa dyowawa, unone ka mwa tawire yenthzi, aterithsi nambuyama o maherehere awo na tawa yenthzi. Karo shaanga ou mwa i monine, ka mwa cerire no ku tawa yenthzi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kakwakunyunga owamango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “Mu teerere kathsimo kamweya. Kwekarire munu yumweya oyu wa dimine dikanda dyo veine no ku di thzingurukithsa thsipaka, wa thsiminemo thsikameno thso waine no ku yaramo otara o kwingera. Ayepo di paka mu moko akwakunyunga no ku thza ruendo. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Thsikati thso ku koyora veine ou thsa kokerire, wa ka tumine apikenthzi kowa akwakunyunga ci a ka mu shimbereko veine wenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Unone awaya akwakunyunga a kwatire waya apika, oyu a mu furire, oyu a mwipaire, o muthsihatu a mu povaurire no mawe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Ngou a tumineko apika owangi kupita o kutanga, nawo karo a ka wa tendire diya a tendire o kutanga.<verse eid="MAT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />“Ku hura wa tumineko honi mwanenthzi no ku amba ci: ‘Kenge a ka remeka mwanange.’<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />“Unone awaya akwakunyunga ou a monine mwanenthzi a ciambathsanine ci: ‘Na kumu shwana, mwiye tu mwipae tu shwane dikanda.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ngou a mu kwatire no ku mu koka ku mu tundithsa mu dikanda no ku ka mwipaa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu wa wepurire ci: “Ou a ku keya thsinda thsa dikanda ne ngepi a ku na wa tenda awaya akwakunyunga?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />A mu tawire ci: “Kenge a ku nepaa awaya akwakunyunga owamango, no ku na paka dikanda mu moko akwakunyunga awo awa a ku mu pangako yenthzi mu thsikati thso ku koyora.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu wa wa amberire ci: “Ene ka mwa tara mu Mañoro yo ku ninga ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“ ‘Diwe edi na kende akwakuumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">di na piruka diunthzi dyo nthzio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">eyi yo na a tende Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">karo atwe i na tu komokithsa!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Mweyo, naa mi ambera ci kenge mwa ku nyangiwa Kutumina kwa Nyambi no ku ku pa kwanu awa a ku mu retera rukuru. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Munu yomuhe oyu wa ku werako oku ku diwe kenge a ku cinathzoka tupinthzipinthzi, ngeci edi diwe adyopo di wera munu, kenge dya ku mwororora.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Akuru o mapurisita nAfarithsi ou a yuvire oto tuthsimo, a nangurire ci shime a ambire yo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Ngou a fotire dikuñwa dyo ku ninga ci a mwange, unone a yapire mbunga pakuninga ci anu shime a shimbire Yesu ci mukwakukethza.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko thsidika thso wenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu wa ambireno karo mu tuthsimo ci: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Kutumina ko ku Wiru kwaa cipitura eci fumu oyu wa kwamenine mwanenthzi thsidika thso wenga. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Thsidika ou thsa kwanine, wa tumine apikenthzi ku ka tongwera awa a raire ku thsidika. Unone wahe a kanine ku keya!<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />“Karo wa tumineko apikenthzi amweya ku ka wa tongwera ci: ‘Thsidika thsi na kwana. Mapuru no mangomwana oanunu a na kañariwa, nenu yoihe i na roithsiwa. Mu keye ku thsidika.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Unone awa a raiwire a i thsembururire, a cithzererire kwako yumweya ku dikanda dyenthzi, yumweya ku muuro wenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Uno honi amweya a kwatire awo apika a tumiwire, ku wa tenda dyodimango no ku wepaa.<verse eid="MAT 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />“Fumu wa anthzipire nene, wa tumineko mashwarare enthzi ku kepaa waya epaanu, no ku ka tumeka mbongi thzo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ngou honi a amberire apikenthzi ci: ‘Thsidika thso wenga thsi na kwana, unone anu awa na ni raa ka roerire edyo direma. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Pano honi mu thze mu mikwakwa thzothzikuru, mu kethsere ku wenga yomuhe oyu mu ka wana.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Apika a thzire mu mikwakwa no ku ka konga wahe awa a ka wanine, owawawa nowa owamango no nthzio thzo wenga thza yarire thzanu.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Unone fumu ou engenine ku ka kenga awa ethsire, wa monine munu oyu wa kanine ku vata evata yo thsidika. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Wa mwipurire ci: ‘Shadi, ngepi o nengena muno mu thsidika ko kupira evata yo thsidika?’ Unone aye ka a wanine yo ku mu tawa. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Fumu wa amberire anduthzienthzi ci: ‘Mu mu kwate mu mwange ku moko no ku mauru, mu mu konthzere pora mu mirema, omu a ka direra no ku cihuma nwaeo.’<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />“Inene angi awa a nethsiwa, unone apu awa a na hanguriwa.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yo ku tera mutero kwa Sesare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Afarithsi ngou a ciwanine pofoci ku ceka mangudi o ku twethsa ku kwaterapo Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />A tumine erongwa yo nakwathsipani thsa Heroda ku kwenthzi. A ka mwipurire ci: “Murongithsi, twaa dimuka ci o di noshemwa, karo waa rongithsa dikuñwa dya Nyambi koshemwa. Ko wa wana ci oyu ne edye, inene ko wana mavwevwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />O tu tongwere, waa mona ngepi, ene yaa tawethziwa ci atwe tu tere mutero kwa Sesare nji dyombo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Unone Yesu wa dimukire eanekera yo yoimango, ngou a ambire ci: “Amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Ine eyi mu ni tera pa rudimi? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Mu ni monithse ao madi mu na cikwathsithsanga ku tera!” A mu tambekire ao madi o muwayawaya, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />aye wepurire ci: “Ethsi thsikupuro nedi dithzina i dipo ne yadye?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />A tawire ci: “Ya Sesare.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Yesu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mu pe Sesare ya Sesare, no Nyambi mu mu pe ya Nyambi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ou a yuvire kengeyo a komokire nene, a mu thsiire no ku cithzera.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yo ku pinduka kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Mwedyo diyuwa karo Asaduki a keyire kwa Yesu, anu awa a kanine ku tawa ci ko ku di kupinduka kwafu. Epurire ci: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Murongithsi, Mushe shime a ambire ci: ‘Ngeci mukwerume aa fa ko kupira mwana, minenthzi aa roera ku yeka oya difakathzi ci erekere mukurwenthzi ana.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Uno honi kwekarire ana munu yofoci o mutanu naidi wakwerume. O kutanga wa yekire mbuyama no ku fa o ku shime ku wana nenthzi ana, ngou a thsierire minenthzi oya difakathzi. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Ya dikarire kengeyo koyu o muthsidi noyu o muthsihatu, mane shime ku ka kuma koyu o muthsitanu naidi. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ku hura mbuyama naye wa fire. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />O tu tongwere, oya mbuyama ne kenge mba ekara munu wadye mu diyuwa dyo kupinduka kwafu? Inene wahe akwa mutanu naidi a mu yekire.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Mu na yongo, inene ka mu dimukire Mañoro, no kukana ku dimuka okoro wa Nyambi. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Inene pa kupinduka kwafu po anu mbera ka yeke nji ku yekiwa. Kenge mbekara eci tungeru to mu wiru. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Uno honi, keyi yo kupinduka kwafu ne, ene ka mwa tara mu Mañoro eyi a ambire Nyambi ci: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Yame no Nyambi wa Aburahama, Nyambi wa Isaka, no Nyambi wa Jakovo’? Eyo yaa monithsa ci Nyambi po kadi Nyambi wafu, unone Nyambi wayumi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Mbunga ou thza yuvire eyi, thza komokire erongithsa yenthzi.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiraerera thsothsikuru mu thsivaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Unone Afarithsi ou a yuvire ci Yesu na tutwarithsa Asaduki komu a wa tawerire, a ciwanine pofoci. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Yumweya ku kwo, mukwakutongonona murao o Thsijuda, wa erekire ku mu ta pa rudimi ko ku mwipura ci: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Murongithsi, thsipi thsiraerera thsothsikuru nene mu thsivaka mu murao wa Mushe?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “ ‘O shime Fumu Nyambi woe ko mucima woe ouhe, ko mwoyo woe ouhe, no maano oe oahe.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ethsi po thsodiyo thsiraerera thso kutanga karo thsodiyo thsothsikuru mu thsivaka. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Thso muthsidi thso ku cipitura nothsi po ethsi, ‘O shime muenthzoe eci edi wa cishima othsinda.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Murao wa Mushe ouhe nerongithsa yakwakukethza yoihe i nemana mweyi eraerera idi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Krisitu ne Mwana edye?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Afarithsi ou a ciwanine pofoci, Yesu wa wepurire ci: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Amwe ne mwaa anekera ngepi keyi ya Mesiya? Mwana edye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">A mu tawire ci: “Mwana Davida.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Wa wa amberire ci: “Ine honi Davida eyi ethserire Mesiya ko Mupepo Oukenu ci: ‘Fumu wange’? Inene Davida wa ambire ci:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“ ‘Fumu wa amberire Fumu wange ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">“O wikare ku dyoko dyange dyo rudyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">shime apa mbo ni pakera akwethzimbo yoe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">kushi thzedyato yoe.” ’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />“Ngeci aye Davida aa mwithsa ci ‘Fumu,’ ngepi karo nga ekara Mesiya ci mwanenthzi?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kwithsa oyu wa mu tawire thsimweya. Ku tunda mwedyo diyuwa kwithsa oyu wa keshukire ku mwipura mangudi.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ambera anu ci a cinyunge kwarongithsi o murao nAfarithsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Yesu ngou a amberire mbunga nerongwa yenthzi ci: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Arongithsi o murao nAfarithsi wodiyo a na shwana thsipura thsa Mushe. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Mweyo, mwaa roera ku hengeka no ku tenda eyi a mi ambera yoihe. Unone mwa temununa eyi a tenda, inene ka shupwerire eyi a rongithsa. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />A anga mipango thzothziremu, no ku thzi pangekithsa anu amweya, uno honi awo ka fotire ku wa yakura shaanga no munwe pohuma.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />“Yoihe eyi a tenda a i tendera ci a wa mone anu. Mu mone, a na cishupeka ku mitwi no ku moko ekwakwati yoikuru omu mu di maywi a Nyambi, no ku vata ekoveyo yo minganja thzothzire. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Aa fotanga nene ku remekiwa pedika no ku fota kwikaranga mwipura yo ku rupara mu masinagoge. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Karo aa fotanga nene ku vumeneniwa ko direma mu maurithsero, no ku fota ci anu a wethsange ci ‘Rabi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Murongithsi.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />“Unone amwe ka mu roerire kwithsiwa ci ‘Murongithsi’, inene mwahe mwana munu yofoci, karo Murongithsi wenu po yofoci pohuma. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Ka mu roerire kwithsa munu pano pashi ci ‘Tata’, inene Tata wenu po yofoci pohuma oyu di mu wiru. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Karo ka mu roerire kwithsiwa ci: ‘Ñathsire,’ inene Ñathsire wenu po yofoci, aye Mesiya. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />O mukuru ku kwenu apwe eci ngamba wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Munu yomuhe o ku cithzineka kenge a ku huthsiwa kushi, o ku cihuthsa kushi kenge a ku thzinekiwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa shomorora Afarithsi narongithsi o murao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mar 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk 11.39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20.47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwarongithsi o murao namwe mwAfarithsi, amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Mwaa yanthzera thsero thzo Kutumina ko ku Wiru ku rupara rwanu. Amwe kadi mwakwa kwingenamo, karo awa a na foto kwingenamo mwaa wa kanithsa. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />[Mwakwothsimo amwe mwArongithsi o murao namwe mwAfarithsi, amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Inene mwaa pupirika mafakathzi no ku wethzera mu manthzio o ko mahetaheta o ku wa tenderanga erombero yoire. Mweyo, humbithso thzenu kenge thza kwikara thzothzikuru ku piterera!]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka thzi di mu mañoro o kutanga.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwarongithsi o murao namwe mwAfarithsi, amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Mwaa mana matunga no ku rea mawate ku ka fota shaanga munu yofoci o ku pirura ci ekare Mujuda. O ku mu na mana ku mu pirura, mu na mu tende rwidi mwana dihere eci amwe.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwatangereri o tupuputwa! Inene mwaa rongithsa anu ci: ‘Munu o kwethza ngoro ko Tembere po ka ethzire ngoro shemwa. Uno honi o kwethza ngoro ko gauda o Tembere po yo na canga yoshemwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Amwe mwa tupuputwa owatomba! Thsothsikuru mu thsivaka ne gauda nji, nji Tembere ethzi thzi na kenithsanga gauda? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Karo mwaa rongithsanga ci: ‘Munu o kwethza ngoro ko katara ko mu Tembere ka ethzire ngoro shemwa. Unone o kwethza ngoro ko nupu ethzi thzi dipo yo na canga shemwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Amwe mwa tupuputwa! Thsothsikuru ne thsipi, nupu ethzi thzidi pa katara nji, nji ako katara ka na kenithsanga nupu? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Mukaci keyo, naa mi ambera ci, munu o kwethza ngoro ko katara nethzi ngoro ko katara neyi i dipo yoihe. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />O kwethza ngoro ko Tembere nethzi ngoro ko Tembere no ku pakerera no Nyambi oyu wa tungumo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Noyu o kwethza ngoro ko diwiru na pakerera no ngunja thza Nyambi no Nyambi oyu nekarapo.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwarongithsi o murao namwe mwAfarithsi, amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Inene mwaa panga Nyambi thso mudikumi keyi mu na dimanga yo ku pitura eci minta, anisi no kumini. Ii, mwaa roera ku pa thso mudikumi, unone ka mu roerire ku thsierera eyi erongithsa yoikuru mu thsivaka yo murao, yo ku pitura eci kupira dipethso, ñeke norurami. Eyi yodiyo mu na roera ku tenda ko kukana ku thsiererako thsimweya! <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Amwe mwaendithsi o tupuputwa! Mwaa cimburamo nthzi mu meyu enu, unone mwaa mina kamere.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwarongithsi o murao namwe mwAfarithsi, amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Inene mwaa yoanga manganja no turonga peuru, unone mushi mu na yara enu yo rununa necikumbwethza yoimango. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Owe o Mufarithsi o kapuputwa, o tange tango ku yoa nganja no karonga mushi, kenge i kena no peuru.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwarongithsi o murao namwe mwAfarithsi, amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Inene mwaa cipitura eci idi yo ku wethsa okenu peuru, yaa monahara nawa peuru, unone mushi ku na yara eshoko yanu o kufa nenu yo kwora. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Namwe dyo mu di kengeyo, anu wahe aa mona ci mwawawa, unone mu micima thzenu mu na yara mahetaheta no ku shwahura murao wa Nyambi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba yo humbithso thzarongithsi o murao nAfarithsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luk 11.47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Mwakwothsimo amwe mwarongithsi o murao namwe mwAfarithsi, amwe mwakwamahetaheta! Inene mwaa umba idi yakwakukethza no ku yenga idi yanu owawawa. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Karo mwaa amba ci: ‘Mu mayuwa o ku manyima, nga ko twekarire, nga ka twa vandire kwikwama yakwathsañuruetu yo kwipaa akwakukethza.’<verse eid="MAT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />“Mweyo, mwaa pa ombangi mwathsinda ci mwanahoka o waya paire akwakukethza. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Apa i di kengeyo, mu shumune eyi a tatekire akwathsañuruenu.<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />“Amwe mwa mayoka! Amwe mwana epidi! Ngepi mwa ku para ku humbithso thzo dihere?<verse eid="MAT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />“Mweyo, mu teerere! Pano naa mi tumithsera akwakukethza nanu owanyanyami narongithsi o murao. Amweya ku kwo kenge mwa ku wepaa, awa amweya kenge mwa ku wamba pa mbinda, amweya kenge mwa ku wa furera mu masinagoge enu o ku mu thza o wa cithzacithza mu mbongi no mbongi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Mweyo, murandu o kwipaa anu owawawa pa kaye kenge wa ku mi thsimanena mwahe. Ku tatekera pa kwipaiwa kwa Abele oyu wekarire o muwawa, shime ku na kuma pa kwipaiwa kwa Zakariya mwana Barakia oyu mwepaerire mu Tembere mu kaci ko Ndau thzo Shokenu no katara. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ethzo raturo kenge thza ku wera anu o rerodino.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa direrera Yerusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Mayuwane Yerusalema, Yerusalema, owe o nepaanga akwakukethza no ku povauranga no mawe tunganda twa Nyambi. Kadi edi ni na fotanga ku paka pofoci anoe eci ñathzishushwa edi a na pakanga tuciyociyo twenthzi mu mando enthzi, unone ko i fotire! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Mu na mono honi, pano nthzio thzenu kenge thza kwikara diundu. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Naa mi tongwera ci ku tunda pano ka mwa ku ni mona karo, shime ou mba mu amba ci: ‘Wa thsiyauthzi oyu keya mu dithzina dya Fumu!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa amba yo kuumburuka ko Tembere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu ou a tundire mu Tembere, erongwa yenthzi ya mu henyenine no ku mu nehethza eumba yo Tembere. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu wa i amberire ci: “Mu na i mono eyi yoihe? Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kwithsa diwe shaanga dyofoci edi dya ku thsiara peuru thzedi dimweya, yoihe kenge ya ku umburuka.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Makando o ku rupara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu ou ekarire pa Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera, erongwa yenthzi ya keyire ku kwenthzi ko kumengi no ku na amba ci: “O tu tongwere thsikati ethsi ya ku tendahara yoihe eyi o ambaura. Karo thsimonithso mwine thsa ku dimukithsa kukeya koe no kupwa ko kaye?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu wa wa tawire ci: “Mu mamere ci katere a ku mi yemburure munu. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Inene, anu owangi kenge a ku keya mu dithzina dyange no ku amba ci: ‘Yame no Krisitu,’ karo kenge a ku yemburura anu owangi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Kenge mwa ku yuva yo mamvo no mapurwatwi o mamvo, unone mwa ku cithzekera. Eyo yaa roera ku tendahara, unone kadi odiyo mahurerero o kaye. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Ditunga kenge dya ku rwithsa ditunga dimweya, no kutumina kenge kwa ku rwithsa kutumina kumweya. Mu mandau o ku cithsiathsia kenge kwa kwikara mandombo no ku ngangama kokukuru ko kaye. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Eyo enu yoihe kenge ya kwikara eci matatekero a mbuyama oyu nyatithsa.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Anu kenge a ku mi kwata no ku mi twara kowa a ku ka mi nyandithsa no ku ka mipaa. Mishovo thzothzihe mu kaye kenge thza ku mi thzimba mukaci ko dithzina dyange. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Mwethso thsikati anu owangi kenge a ku thsia thsitawo thso, amweya kenge a ku cangithsa no ku cithzimba. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Akwakukethza o mbango owangi kenge a ku keya no ku nangera anu owangi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kushwahura murao wa Nyambi kenge kwa ku kura nene, thsishimo thsanu owangi kenge thsa ku pupuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Unone oyu wa ku citanarithsa shime ku ka kuma ku hura kenge a ku yoyithsiwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Muthzimbu Ouwa o Kutumina kwa Nyambi kenge wa ku hongiwa mu kaye kokahe ci ikare ombangi kwanu o mishovo thzothzihe, mbeci kwa ku keye mahurerero o kaye.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeya ko makando oshokuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ou mwa ku mona omango o kupiterera o ku reta oundu ou a tongorire mukwakukethza Daniele o ku u di mu Ndau thzo Shokenu (oyu tara a yuvithsithse nawa), <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />apo honi awa di mu Judea a ku cirere ku mikinya, <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />munu oyu di pa thsituwa thso nthzio a shiruka kwingena mu nthzio thzenthzi ci a ka rongitikeye enu. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Karo oyu di mu dikanda a huka ku diumbo ci a ka shimbe thsikoveyo thsenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Mayuwane othsimo wambuyama awa a kwikara poremu nowa a ku yamwithsa mwao mayuwa! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Mu rombere kwa Nyambi ci kucira kwenu kwa kwikara pa kufu nji mu diyuwa dyo Savata. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Inene mwethso thsikati kenge kwa kwikara dikarara dyodikuru, kupita oahe aa ekarako ku tunda ku matatekero o kaye shime ku na kuma thsino thsikati, karo mbera ka dikarako. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Napoci Nyambi ku anekera ku tepurura koa mayuwa o makando, nga kwithsa munu oyu wa ku yoya, unone mukaci kanu awa naa cihangwera Nyambi, kenge a ku a tepurura.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Kethsiya thsikati ngeci munu waa ku mi tongwere ci: ‘Mu mone, Krisitu ono kuno’ nji ci ‘Oya kuya,’ mwa ku i tawa. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Inene kenge kwa ku keya akrisitu o mbango nakwakukethza o mbango. Awo kenge a ku tenda emonithso nekomokithsa yoikuru yo ku komokithsa, kwangera anu, shaanga awa naa hangura Nyambi nga ayopo i tawa. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mu teerere, ni na i mi tongwera ayo o ku i shime ku tendahara.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Mweyo, shaanga anu wa ku mi tongwere ci: ‘Ono kuno mu dikunguthsitu,’ mwa ku thzako. Nji ci ‘Mu mone, o na cihoreka kuya,’ mwa ku i tawa. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Inene dyodiya ku nekaranga kwethsa ko mvura ku tunda ku muvo ku thza ku mutoko, no kukeya kwa Mwana Munu dyo kwa kwikara. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Oku ku di thsinu thso kufa kodiyo a ciwanawanena makwi.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeya kwa Mwana Munu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Popa a ku pwa ao mayuwa o makando, diyuwa kenge dya kwiraura, ngonda ka thza kwikara no mwethzi, matungwethzi kenge a ku wa ku wiru, karo yoshokoro yo mu wiruwiru kenge ya ku ngangama.<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />“Ngou honi athso thsimonithso thso kukeya kwa Mwana Munu thsa ku monahara mu wiru. Mishovo thzothzihe thzo kaye kenge thza ku dira, karo kenge a ku cimonena Mwana Munu o ku keya mu mavui o diwiru kokoro no kutethzima kokukuru. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Kenge a ku tuma tungeru twenthzi, karo kenge kwa ku dira muvumo oukuru o torombita. Kenge twa ku paka pofoci awa na a hangura mu mambango ane o kaye, ku tatekera ku matatekero o diwiru shime ku ka kuma ku mamaneneno adyo.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo thsitondo thsokuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mu cirongithse thsimweya pa thsitondo thsokuyu, kamona thziotopa mite thzao no ku hoka mamuna mwaa dimuka ci mvura pepi a di. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Mofoci, ou mwa ku mona yoihe eyi o ku i tendahara mu dimuke ci Mwana Munu pepi a di, mane pa thsero mwene. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci anu awa yoya kethsino thsikati ka ku fa wahe eyi yoihe o ku i shime ku tendahara. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Diwiru no kaye kenge ya ku pwa, unone maywi ange ao mbera ka a pu.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsikati thso mahurerero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Unone yo diyuwa no thsikati kwithsa oyu na i dimuka, shaanga tungeru to ku wiru, nji Mwana, shime Tata pohuma yofoci yo na i dimuka.<verse eid="MAT 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />“Kukeya kwa Mwana Munu kenge kwa ku cipitura eci thsikati thsa Nuwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Mwao mayuwa dimina o ku di shime, anu a dire, a nwine, a yekire, a yekithsire, mane shime ku ka kuma mu diyuwa edi engenine Nuwe mu areka. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Ka dimukire thsimweya shime dimina ou dya kumine no ku na wa pukithsa wahe, dyo ya kwikara no mu diyuwa dyo kukeya kwa Mwana Munu.<verse eid="MAT 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />“Kethso thsikati, kwakwerume aidi awa kwikara mu dikanda, yumweya kenge a ku shimbiwa, yumweya kenge a ku thsiiwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Kwambuyama aidi awa a ku twa mu kakunthzu, yumweya kenge a ku shimbiwa, yumweya kenge a ku thsiiwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Mu mamere, inene ka mu dimukire diyuwa edi a ku keya Fumu wenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Mu dimuke ci nga thsinda thsa nthzio aa dimukanga thsikati ethsi a keya mwithzi, nga aa kuñweranga ku nyunga nthzio thzenthzi karo tumba nga a tanekera nthzio thzenthzi o ku thzi tuviwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Namwe mwikare o ku mu na ciroithsera thsikati thsothsihe, inene Mwana Munu kenge a ku keya thsikati ethsi mu na kana ku taterera.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo ko ngamba o muwawa noyu o mumango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Edye ngamba o mururami karo o munyanyami, oyu a pire ñathsire wenthzi ku endithsa aenthzenthzi angamba no ku wa panga edya ko thsikati ethsi thsi na roera? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Wa thsiyauthzi oyo ngamba ngeci ñathsire wenthzi waa ku na mu wane o ku tendanga kengeyo ou a ku na kuma. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ñathsire wenthzi kenge a ku mu pa ku endithsa rufumo rwenthzi roruhe. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Unone ngeci oyo ngamba po mumango, karo waa ku ambe mu mucima wenthzi ci: ‘Ñathsire wange ka a ku ka huka wangu’, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />no ku tateka ku furanga aenthzenthzi angamba, no ku dya no ku nwa netakwa, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />ñathsire oya ngamba ou a ku ka huka mu diyuwa edi a na kana ku mu taterera no mu thsikati ethsi a na kana ku dimuka, <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />kenge a ku mu thsanyaura no ku mu pa humbithso ethzi thzi na roera akwamahetaheta, oku a ku ka direra no ku cihuma nwaeo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="rem">LK, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kambanda o dikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Mwethso thsikati Kutumina ko ku Wiru kenge kwa kwikara eci ambanda o dikumi awa shimbire tumbarambara two ku ka taterera mukwakuyeka. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />O mutanu ku kwo nedi a tomba, karo o mutanu nedi a nyanyami. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Awo owatomba a shimbire tumbarambara, unone ka shimbire maathzi amweya ku mbadi. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Owanyanyami awo a shimbire tumbarambara no maathzi amweya ku mbadi mu tufuma. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Mukwakuyeka shime a katapire ku keya, wahe a tatekire ku nyongera no ku thza pa turo ku rara.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Pa kaci kothsiku kakumbo ka yuvaharire ci: ‘Mukwakuyeka na kumu!’ ‘Mu keye mu mu shambawere!’<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />“Ambanda wahe o dikumi a pindukire no ku roaroithsa tumbarambara two. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Awo owatomba a amberire owanyanyami ci: ‘Mu tu peko ku maathzi enu, tumbarambara twetu koku thzimana kwato.’<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />“Unone owanyanyami awo a tawire ci: ‘Dyombo, ka i tawa, ka a tu kwana atwe namwe. Mu thze kowa na urithsa maathzi mu ka ciurere enu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />“Awaya ambanda ou a thzire ku ka ura maathzi, kuno kunyima mukwakuyeka wa kumine. Ambanda waya a ciroithserire engenine na mukwakuyeka mu nthzio thzo thsidika no thsero thza patiwire.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Ou kwa pitire thsikati thsothsipu, awaya ambanda amweya nawo a kumine no ku na amba ci: ‘Ñathsire wetu, ñathsire wetu! O tu yanthzurwere!’<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />“Unone mukwakuyeka wa wa tawire ci: ‘Naa mi ambera yoshemwa ka ni mi dimuka.’<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />“Mweyo, namwe mu ciroithsere, inene ka mu dimukire diyuwa nji thsikati.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathsimo kangamba ahatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Karo, Kutumina kwa Nyambi kenge kwa kwikara eci mukwerume oyu wa thzire ruendo. Wethsire angambenthzi no ku wa pa ku nyunga rufumo rwenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />O ku tanga aa mu pa tuthsaka mutanu to madi o muwayawaya o silivera, o muthsidi tuthsaka twidi, wa pire o muthsihatu kathsaka kofoci. Wa pire munu no munu komu a twethserire, aye no ku thza mu ruendo rwenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Oya munu wa tamburire tuthsaka mutanu, wa kwamithsire aya madi no ku wanenapo tuthsaka mutanu peuru. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Noya wa tamburire tuthsaka twidi, wa waneninepo tuthsaka twidi peuru. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Unone oya wa tamburire kathsaka kofoci, wa thzire no ku ka thsima diteke mu muve ku vumbekamo madi a ñathsire wenthzi ku a horeka.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Ou kwa pitire thsikati thsothsire ñathsire o waya angamba wa ka hukire no ku na tarururano thsitoko. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Oya mukwerume wa tamburire tuthsaka mutanu wa henyenine kwa ñathsire wenthzi no ku mu pa tuthsaka mutanu otu a waneninepo. Wa ambire ci: ‘Ñathsire wange shime wa ni pire tuthsaka mutanu, o mone, na ni wanenapo to mutanu peuru.’<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />“Ñathsire wenthzi wa mu tawire ci: ‘No tende nawa owe o ngamba o muwawa karo o mururami! No tende nawa penu yoipu, kenge ni ku pa ku endithsa enu yoingi. O keye na tu nyanyukere pofoci!’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Noya wa tamburire tuthsaka twidi wa keyire. Wa ambire ci: ‘Ñathsire wange, shime wa ni pire tuthsaka twidi, o mone, na ni wanenapo twidi peuru.’<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />“Ñathsire wenthzi wa mu tawire ci: ‘No tende nawa owe o ngamba o muwawa karo o mururami! No tende nawa penu yoipu, kenge ni kupa ku endithsa enu yoingi. O keye na tu nyanyukere pofoci!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Ngou kwa keyire honi oya ngamba a pire kathsaka kofoci, wa na ambire ci: ‘Ñathsire wange, na ni dimuka ci o munu o mukaru, o ku twethsa ku cora omu no kana ku kuna, no ku kongora omu no kana ku kuwa mbuto. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Mweyo, na ni yapa ngou na ni vumbeka madi oe mu muve. O mone, madi oe aa ni na ka a huthsa.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Ñathsire wenthzi wa mu tawire ci: ‘Owe o ngamba o mumango o muva! No dimuka ci naa coranga omu na ni kana ku kuna, no ku kongora omu na ni kana ku kuwa mbuto? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ine eyi no kana ku paka aa madi mu panga, ci uno ni na ka huka nga ni na wanenapo ko peuru?<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />“‘Mu mu nyange ako kathsaka ko madi, mu ka pe oyu di notu to dikumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Inene oyu di nethsi thsimweya kenge a ku vungithsiwera ci ekare neyi yoingi, unone oyu na piri kenge a ku nyangiwa shaanga kokapu aka a di nako. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Oyu ngamba o mumango mu mu konthzere pora mu mirema, omu a ka direra no ku cihuma nwaeo.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raturo thzo mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Ou mba a keya Mwana Munu mu kutethzima kwenthzi, no tungeru totuhe, kenge mba ekara pa ngunja thzo kutethzima. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Anu o mu matunga oahe, kenge mba kongeriwa pa rupara rwenthzi, karo kenge mba a tepa anu eci mudithsani oyu tepa mangu ku membe. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Kenge mba a paka mangu ku rudyo rwenthzi no membe ku rumoho rwenthzi.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />“Fumu kenge mba a ambera honi awa o ku rudyo rwenthzi ci: ‘Mu keye, amwe naa fiyawera Tata, na mu tambure Kutumina oku mwa roithsiwerire ku tunda ku matatekero o kaye. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Inene ou na fire nthzara mwa ni pire edya, ou na fire dinotwa mwa ni pire meyu o ku nwa, nekarire mwenda mwa ni tamburire, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />ou na fire wira mwa ni pire evata, ou na korire mwa ni korithsire, ou nekarire mu kamenga mwa ni thzingurire.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Owawawa kenge mba mwipura ci: ‘Fumu, diyuwa dipi twa ku monine o ku na fu nthzara atwepo tu ku pa edya, nji oku na fu dinotwa atwepo tu ku pa meyu o ku nwa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Kupi twa ku monine o ku di mwenda atwepo tu ku tambura, nji o ku di mu wira atwepo tu ku pa evata. <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Diyuwa dipi twa ku monine o ku kora nji o ku di mu kamenga atwepo tu ka ku thzingura?’<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />“Fumu kenge mba a wa tawa ci: ‘Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yoihe eyi na mu tende koyu omuonye kowa aenthzange owaonye yame na mu i tende.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Uno honi kenge mba a ambera o ku rumoho rwenthzi ci: ‘Mu tunde ku kwange amwe mwakwa thsikuto, mu thze mu mudiro o diyere ou wa roithsiwerire shamaonga no tungeru twenthzi! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Inene ou na fire nthzara ka mwa ni pire edya, ou na fire dinotwa ka mwa ni pire meyu o ku nwa, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />ou nekarire mwenda ka mwa ni tamburire, ou nekarire mu wira ka mwa ni pire evata, ou na korire no kwikara mu kamenga ka mwa ni thzingurire.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Nawo kenge mba mu tawa ci: ‘Fumu, diyuwa dipi twa ku monine o ku na fu nthzara, o ku na fu dinotwa nji o ku di mwenda nji o ku di mu wira nji o ku kora nji kwikara mu kamenga, unone atwepo tu kwanga ku ku kwathsa?’<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />“Aye kenge mba a wa tawa ci: ‘Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci munu yomuhe oyu mwa kanine ku kwathsa kowa owaonye, yame mwa kanine ku kwathsa.’<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />“Awo kenge mba thza mu humbithso thzo diyere, unone owawawa awo kenge mba thza mu mwoyo o diyere.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Kayongo ko kwipaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu ou a manine ku rongithsa yoihe eyo, wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mu na dimuka ci ku na thsiara mayuwa edi ci Thsidika thso Paseka thsi tateke, apo Mwana Munu kenge a ku twariwa ku ka mwamba pa mbinda.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Kethsiya thsikati akuru o mapurisita nakuru o mbunga a ciwanawanine ku dirapa dya Kayafa oyu wekarire mupurisita shokuru, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />ku yongora edi nga a twethsa ku kwatera Yesu ku mukunda no ku mwipaa. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Unone a ningire ci: “Twa i kwama mu thsikati thso thsidika, inene kenge nga ya ku reta ci mbunga thzi tende mikwangarakanyi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuyama aa wethsa Yesu thsende mu Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joh 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu o ku di mu Betania mu nthzio thza Simoni wengondwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />kwa keyire mbuyama ku kwenthzi no kakeka ko alabasitere ko thsende o ku tura nene no ku mu shukumwena pa mutwi wa Yesu o ku nekara ku tafure.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Erongwa ou ya monine kengeyo ya anthzipire no ku amba ci: “Kwa ine oko kupethsapethsa ko kengeyo? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Oyu thsende nga na urithsiwa pa madi oangi no ku a pa ahepwe!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu pa ku dimuka eyi ya ambire, wa i amberire ci: “Ine eyi mu mu shupera oyu mbuyama pa ku kwama thsinu thsothsiwa ku kwange? <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Kenge mwikaranga nahepwe thsikati thsothsihe, unone ame ka mwikaranga nange thsikati thsothsihe. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Oyu mbuyama eyi a na kwama yo ku ni shukumwena thsende perama po aa roithsera erama yange ku vumbekiwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci kokuhe oku mba u hongiwa Muthzimbu Ouwa mu kaye kokahe, oyu mbuyama kenge mba a vurukiwa keyi a na kwama.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Judasi aa tawa ku omba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Ngou Judasi Isikariota yumweya pa tunganda to dikumi na twidi a thzire kwakuru o mapurisita <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />no ku ka wepura ci: “Ine eyi nga mu ni pa ngeci amepo ni mi ombera Yesu?” Ngou a tarire madi o ku kuma mu makumi ahatu o muwayawaya o silivera no ku a mu pa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Ku tunda apo, Judasi wa fotire thsikati thsothsiwa thso ku omba Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa dya Paseka nerongwa yenthzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22.7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Mu diyuwa dyo kutanga dyo Thsidika thso Makende o kupira Mamene, erongwa ya keyire kwa Yesu no ku na mwipura ci: “Kupi o na foto ci tu ka ku roithsereko ci o ka dyereko Paseka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Wa i tawire ci: “Mu thze mu mbongi kenge mu ka wana mukwerume, mu ka mu ambere ci: ‘Murongithsi aa amba ci: Thsikati thsange thsi na kumu, naa fota ku na dyera Paseka mu nthzio thzoe nerongwa yange.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Erongwa ya tendire dyodi a i amberire Yesu no ku ka roithsa murarero o Thsidika thso Paseka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Runguro, Yesu wekarire nerongwa yenthzi yo dikumi na idi ku tafure. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />O kwa dya Yesu wa ambire ci: “Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci yumweya ku kwenu kenge a ni omba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ko mathsiwa oakuru, a tatekire ku mwipura munu no munu kukwo ci: “Fumu, ene yame nji?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Oyu nerera nange mu karonga yo wa ku ni omba. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana Munu aa roera ku fa eci edi i na ñoriwa mu Mañoro, unone o di nothsimo oyu munu wa ku mu omba! Nga yekarire nawa ci oyu munu nga ka erekiwire.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Judasi mukwa ku mu omba naye wa mwipurire ci: “Murongithsi, ene yame nji?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu wa tawire ci: “O na amba!”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Murarero o mahurerero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />O kwa dya kengeyo, Yesu wa shimbire dikende no ku di fiyawera. Wa di kuyaurire no ku di pa erongwa yenthzi no ku amba ci: “Mu shimbe mu dye, eyi po erama yange.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Karo wa shimbire nganja thzo waine no ku kanderera kwa Nyambi. Wa thzi wa pire no ku amba ci: “Mwaheno mu nwemo. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Ou po onyinga wange o thsiyuvano thsa Nyambi nanuenthzi. Waa mwaarera anu owangi ci evi i teteriwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Naa mi tongwera yoshemwa ci ka na ku nwa karo oyu waine shime mu diyuwa edi na ku mu nwa ope nenu mu Kutumina kwa Tata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ngou embire dimbo no ku thza ku Mukinya wEtondo yo Miywera.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ambera Peturu ci kenge a mu hamura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Yesu wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Uno othsiku wa rero mwaheno kenge mu cira ku ni thsia nofoci, inene mu Mañoro ku na ñoriwa ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">“ ‘Kenge na kwipaa mudithsani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">no mutanga o mangu kenge wa ku panthzaana.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zak 13.7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />“Unone munyima thzo kupinduka kwange kwafu, kenge na ku citangethza ku Galilea.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Peturu wa ambire ci: “Shaanga ci wa cire wahe ku ku thsia, ame dinice ku ku thsia.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu wa tawire Peturu ci: “Naa ku tongwera yoshemwa ci o uno othsiku wa rero ñombwe o ku shime kwiya kenge o ni hamura ruhatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Unone Peturu wa mu tawire ci: “Shaanga ku fa kenge ni fa noe, ka na ku ku hamura!” Nerongwa imweya yoihe ya ambire kengeyo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa rombera mu Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yesu ngou a thzire nerongwa yenthzi ku ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa Getesemani. Wa amberire erongwa yenthzi ci: “Mwikare pano uno ni thza paya ku ka rombera.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Wa shimbire Peturu nana Zebedea aidi. Wa tatekire ku cithzekera no kwikara mu mathsiwa oakuru. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Wa i amberire ci: “Ni di no mathsiwa oakuru nene mu mucima wange ku ninga ci mane eci nene ni fe. Mwikare pano, mu kuñwere nange.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Wa i thsiire kamanana, wa kupamine no ku rombera ci: “Tata, ngeci yaa tawa, ethzi nganja thzo makando nga thzi tunde ku kwange. Unone ku tendiwe omu o na shimena owe kadi omu ni na shimena ame.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Wa hukire kwirongwa yenthzi no ku ka i wana o ku i na rara. Wa amberire Peturu ci: “Ene tumba nga mu twethsa ku hungera nange shaanga thsitunde thsofoci nji? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Mu hungere no ku rombera ci katere mwingene mwiereka. Mucima waa fota, unone erama yaa kwanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Wa i thsiire karo ro muthsidi no ku ka rombera ci: “Tata, ngeci ethzi nganja tumba nga thzi tawa ku thzi tundithsa ku kwange shime ci ni nwemo, eshima yoe i tendahare.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ou a hukire karo kwirongwa yenthzi, wa ka i wanine o ku i na rara pakuninga ci meho ayo a remine.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ngou a i thsiire no ku huka ku ka rombera karo ro muthsihatu o ku ambanga thsinu thsofoci. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Wa hukire kwirongwa yenthzi no ku ka amba ci: “Ene shimbi mwa rarera no ku turumwithsa? Mu mone! Thsikati thsi na kumu thso kuninga ci Mwana Munu a piwe mu moko anu wevi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Mu pinduke tu thze! Mukwa ku ni omba na kumu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa kwatiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joh 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu o ku amba kengeyo, Judasi, yumweya o tunganda to dikumi na twidi wa kumine nanu owangi awa a shimbire myere no miramu. Shime a wa tumine akuru o mapurisita nakuru o mbunga. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Judasi mukwa ku mu omba wa wa pire thsimonithso ci: “Oyu ni ka yamwa yodiyo oyu mu fota. Mu ka mu kwate.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Judasi wa keyererire kwa Yesu no ku na amba ci: “Shangwe Murongithsi!” No ku mu yamwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Shadi, ngo kwame pohuma eyi o neyera.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Popo anu awa endire nenthzi a kwatire Yesu no ku mwanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Unone yumweya kowa ekarire na Yesu wa shwamunine mwere no ku teta ditwi dya mupika mupurisita shokuru.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu wa mu amberire ci: “O pake mwere woe mu ndaro thzao, inene wahe o ku kwamithsa mwere kenge a ku paiwa ko mwere. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ene ko dimukire ci nga naa fota ku kwathsiwa kenge nga ni romba Tata, karo kenge nga a ni tumena popano epani yoikuru yo kupiterera dikumi na idi yo tungeru? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Uno honi ngeci amepo ni tenda kengeyo, ngepi nga a citombora Mañoro neyi i na roera ku tendahara pano?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Kethsiya thsikati Yesu wa amberire ethzo mbunga ci: “Ene no thsikeremi yo ku ni keyera no myere no miramu ku na ni kwata? Ine eyi na mu kana ku ni kwata uya na nikaranga nenu mu Tembere mayuwa oahe o ku ni rongithsa? <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Uno honi eyi yoihe ya tendaharera ci i citombore neyi a ñorire akwakukethza mu Mañoro.” Popo erongwa yoihe ya cirire ku mu thsia.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa twariwa mu Nthzango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Joh 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Awa a kwatire Yesu a mu twarire kwa Kayafa oyu wekarire mupurisita shokuru oku a ciwanawanenine arongithsi o murao nakuru o mbunga. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Peturu wa mu shupwerire o ku enderanga kokure shime ku ka kuma ku dirapa dya mupurisita shokuru. Wengenine mu dirapa no kwikara nakwakunyunga ku tanekera oku i ka pwera.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Akuru o mapurisita no Nthzango thzothzihe a fotire ombangi o mbango ci a paerepo Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Unone ka u wanine, shaanga ci kwa keyire mambangi oangi o kwithsa. Ku hura kwa keyire anu aidi <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />no ku na amba ci: “Oyu munu shime naa amba ci aa twethsa ku umburura Tembere thza Nyambi no ku thzi umba karo mu mayuwa ahatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mupurisita shokuru wemanine no kwipura Yesu ci: “Ene kwithsa ethsi nga o huthsako kweyi enu a ku capa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Unone Yesu ka a tawire. Mupurisita Shokuru wa mu amberire ci: “Naa kwethzera ngoro mu dithzina dya Nyambi oyu yoya ci o tu tongwere ngeci yowe o Mesiya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po “Krisitu” ku amba ci “Mesiya.”</char></note> Mwana Nyambi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu wa tawire ci: “Dyodi o amba. Uno honi naa mi ambera ci ku tunda pano kenge mbo mu mona Mwana Munu o ku nekara ku dyoko dyo rudyo dya Nyambi Shokoro noku keya mu mavui o mu wiru.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Popo mupurisita shokuru wa yaturire evata yenthzi no ku amba ci: “Na yengwa! Ine eyi tu fotera mambangi karo? Mu na ciyuvera o ku yengwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Amwe ne mwa i anekera ngepi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Awo a tawire ci: “Aa roera ku fa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ngou a mu thsipaerire mate pa rupara no ku mu fura no mafaindi. Amweya a mu furire mambanda <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />no ku amba ci: “Krisitu, o ukethze oyu na ku furu ci edye?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peturu aa hamura Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joh 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Peturu shime ekarire pora mu dirapa. Kwa keyire ngamba o mbuyamaana no ku ambera Peturu ci: “Nowe shime wa ekaranga na Yesu o ku Galilea.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Unone wa hamurire pa meho anu wahe ci: “Ka ni i dimuka eyi o amba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Peturu ngou a tuturukerire ku thsero thzo dirapa. Ngamba yumweya o mbuyamaana wa mu monine no ku ambera anu awa ekarirepo ci: “Oyu munu shime aekara na Yesu o ku Nazareta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Wa hamurire karo no kwethza ngoro ku amba ci: “Ka ni mu dimuka oyu munu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Munyima thzo thsikati thsothsipu, anu awa emanine apo a keyire kwa Peturu no ku mu ambera ci: “Yoshemwa nowe o mukwa mu thsipani thso, inene ambithso thzoe thzaa monithsa nawanawa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Peturu wa tatekire ku cikuya no kwethza ngoro ci: “Ka ni mu dimuka oyu munu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Popo ñombwe weyire. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Popo Peturu wa vurukire eyi a mu amberire Yesu yo kuninga ci: “Ñombwe o ku shime kwiya kenge o ni hamura ruhatu.” Wa punine pora no ku ka cithziurura ku dira.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa twariwa kwa Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Joh 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ruura mathsikuthsiku, akuru o mapurisita wahe nakuru o mbunga a ciwanawanine karo ku ciyongora dyo kwipaa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ngou a mwangire no ku mu twara ku ka mu pa mu moko a nguvuru Pilatu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Judasi aa cihonda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Ete 1.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Judasi mukwa ku mu omba ou a monine ci Yesu na ratweriwa kufa, wa cerire no ku huthsa aya madi o muwayawaya o makumi ahatu kwakuru o mapurisita nakuru o mbunga. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Judasi wa wa amberire ci: “Na ni tende thsivi pa ku omba munu o kupira murandu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Unone awo a mu tawire ci: “Eyo ne tu i tende ngepi atwe? Eyo po yoe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Judasi wa konthzerire ao madi mu Tembere, no ku thza ku ka ciangerera muothzi mu thsingo ku cipaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Akuru o mapurisita a torire ao madi no ku amba ci: “Murao wetu ka u tawethzire ci madi o kenge a pakiwe mu thsipaupau thso Tembere, pakuninga ci madi aa naa piti pa mwoyo o munu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ou a manine ku ciyuva eyo, a urire dikanda kwa mukwakumba tunyungu toma no ku di tenda mararo enda. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Eyi yodiyo di nethsiwera no rerodino ci Dikanda dyOnyinga. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Eyi ya tendaharire ci i citombore neyi a ñorire mukwakukethza Jeremia yo ku amba ci: “A na shimbi makumi ahatu o muwayawaya o silivera o muuro wenthzi, eci edi a ciyuvire Maisiraele. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Na urupo dikanda kwa mukwakumba tunyungu toma eci edi a ni raire Fumu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zak 11.12</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-9">Jer 32.6-9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu kuta thza Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Joh 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu wa kemanine pa meho a Pilatu nguvuru o Muroma oyu wa mwipurire ci: “Ene yowe o fumu o Majuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu wa mu tawire ci: “Ii, dyodi o amba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Unone ou a mu capire eamba akuru o mapurisita nakuru o mbunga, ka a tawire thsimweya. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pilatu wa mu amberire ci: “Ene ko yuvire eyi enu yo shongi a ku capa?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Unone Yesu ka a huthsireko shaanga diywi dyofoci. Eyo ya komokithsire nene Pilatu.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa ratweriwa kufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joh 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Pa thsidika no thsidika thso Paseka nguvuru shime a punithserangire anu thsinthzinda thsothsihe ethsi a fotire. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Kethsiya thsikati kwekarire thsinthzinda oyu wa yukire nene o dithzina dyo Barabasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Mbunga ou thza ciwanawanine, Pilatu wepurire ci: “Edye oyu mu na foto ci ni mi punithsere, Barabasi nji Yesu oyu nethsiwa Krisitu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilatu wa dimukire ci anu shime a retire Yesu ku kwenthzi mukaci ko mbamba.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilatu o ku nekara mu thsipura thso ku ratwera, munuwenthzi wa mu tumenine diywi dyo kuninga ci: “Wa vanda yenthzi oyo munu o kupira murandu, inene shime ni na shupeka nene ku turo ku rota yenthzi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Unone akuru o mapurisita nakuru o mbunga a hongaurire anu ci a rombe ku wa punithsera Barabasi no kwipaa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Nguvuru karo wa wepurire ci: “Yupi kowa aidi oyu mu na foto ci ni mi punithsere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">A tawire ci: “Barabasi!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilatu wa wepurire ci: “Oyu Yesu nethsiwa Krisitu ne ni mu tende ngepi aye?” Wahe a tawire ci: “Ambiwe pa mbinda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilatu wepurire ci: “Murandu mwine naa tende?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Unone mbunga thza yoomokire nene ku amba ci: “O mwambe pa mbinda!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilatu wa pirire dyo ku tenda, karo wa monine ci kenge nga pa tunda mukwangarakanyi. Wa shimbire meyu no ku cihupa ku moko pa meho anu no ku amba ci: “Ame ka ni di no murandu mu kufa koyu munu! Eyo po yenu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Mbunga thzothzihe thza tawire ci: “Murandu o kufa kwenthzi wikare wetu nanetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Pilatu ngou a wa punithserire Barabasi, no ku tumina ci Yesu a mwashuriwe no ku u wa pa ci a ka mwambe pa mbinda.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mashwarare aa varaera Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joh 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Mashwarare a Pilatu a shimbire Yesu no ku mu twara mu marombe a Pilatu. Thsipani thso mashwarare thsothsihe thsa konganenine kwa Yesu no ku mu paka mu kaci. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />A mu shupurire evata yenthzi no ku mu vateka thsikoveyo thsothsikihu thso thsifumu. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />A thzingire mushukwe o miunga no ku u mu shupeka ku mutwi no ku mu kwatererithsa dingondo ku dyoko dyo rudyo. Ngou a tongamine pa rupara rwenthzi no ku mu varaera ci: “Shooshoo Fumu o Majuda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />A mu thsipaerire mate no ku shimba edyo dingondo ku di mu fura pa mutwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ou a manine ku mu varaera a mu shupurire ethso thsikoveyo thso thsifumu. A mu vatithsire eto yenthzi no ku mu punithsa pora ku ka mwamba pa mbinda.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu a ambiwa pa mbinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />O kwa tunda kengeyo mu mbongi, a hanganine mukwerume o dithzina dyo Simoni, o mu mbongi ethzi thzi nethsiwa Sirene. A mu ooterire ku shimba mbinda thza Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ou a kumine pa ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa Gologota, (ku amba ci Ndau thzo Katendere), <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />a pire Yesu waine o ku vandakana no muthzi oururu ci a nwe. Unone ou a mu erekire, wa kanine ku mu nwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ou a manine ku mwamba pa mbinda, a cierire eto yenthzi ko ku pepa ñera. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Mem 22.18</ref>. </char> </note> <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Munyima thzeyo ekarire pashi no ku mu nyunga. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Peuru thzo mutwi wenthzi a pakirepo thsidimukithso thso murandu wenthzi ci: “Oyu po Yesu, Fumu o Majuda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />A mwambire nethzi aidi, oyu ku rudyo oyu ku rumoho. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus is crucified" file="cn01836b.tif" size="span" loc="Mat 27:32-38" copy="Cook" ref="27.35-38">Yesu o ku nambiwa pa mbinda</figure><verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Anu awa a pitire mu dikuñwa a nyungire mitwi ko ku mu varaera, no ku mu yengwera ci: <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Ewa, yowe no ningi ci waa twethsa ku umburura Tembere no ku thzi umba karo mu mayuwa ahatu. O ciyoyithse othsinda ne! Ngeci yowe o Mwana Nyambi o shiruke apo pa mbinda!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Akuru o mapurisita, arongithsi o murao nakuru o mbunga nawo a mu varaerire. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />A ambire ci: “Naa yoyithsa amweya, unone aye aa kwanga ku ciyoyithsa! Ene kadi yodiyo Fumu o Maisiraele oyu? A shiruke popano apa pa mbinda wangu tu tawe ku kwenthzi. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Na a kurupera Nyambi, pano honi a mu amwene ne ngeci Nyambi wa ku mu shima. Inene shime na a amba ci: ‘Yame no Mwana Nyambi.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />No waya ethzi ambiwire nenthzi a mu varaerire kengeyo.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Diyuwa o ku di di pa kaci ko mutwi, mirema thza thsikire ditunga dyodihe mwitunde ihatu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ko thsikati thso muthsihatu runguro Yesu wa kumbire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Eli, Eli lama sabakatani?” ku amba ci: “Nyambi wange, Nyambi wange, waa ni thsiererera ine?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.46 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Mem 22.1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Amweya kowa emanine po pepi ou a yuvire eyo, a ambire ci: “Aethsa Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Popo yumweya kukwo wa ndandumukire no ku ka shimba thsiponji no ku thsi cimbeka mu waine o kuwawata. Wa thsi pakire ku dimbungu no ku mu pa ci a nwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Unone amweya a ambire ci: “O thsie tango tu mone ngeci Eliya kenge a keya ku na mu yoyithsa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu ngou a kumbire karo ko diywi dyodikuru no ku mina mwoyo. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Popo dimbatu dyo mu Tembere dya yaturiwire epinthzi idi, ku tatekera ku wiru ku twara pashi. Kaye ka ngangamine no mawe a yatathzokire. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Idi ya yanthzurukire, nethzimbi yoingi yanua Nyambi awa a fire ya pindukire kwafu. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />A tundire mu idi yo Yesu ou a pindukire kwafu, engenine mu thsikuña thso shokenu thsa Yerusalema omu a monaharire kwanu owangi.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Muendithsi o mashwarare o Maroma no mashwarare amweya aa a nyungire nenthzi Yesu ou a monine kungangama ko kaye neyi ya tendaharire yoihe, a yapire nene no ku amba ci: “Oyu munu yashemwa nedi Mwana Nyambi!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Ambuyama owangi awa a shupwerire Yesu ku tunda ku Galilea o kwa mu kwathsa, emanine kokure kamanana ku tanekera eyi ya tendaharire. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mu kaciko kwekarire Madiya Magadalena, Madiya mama wa Jakovo na Josefa, no mama wa Jakovo na Johani ana Zebedea.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aa vumbekiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Runguro kwa keyire mukwerume o fumanyi o ku Arimatea. Dithzina dyenthzi po nedi Josefa, naye nedi thsirongwa thsa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Wa thzire kwa Pilatu no ku ka romba erama ya Yesu. Pilatu wa tuminine ci a i piwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Josefa wa shimbire erama ya Yesu no ku i vungera mu dimbatu dyodikenu dyo lineni. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Ngou a i pakire mu thsidi thsothsipe ethsi a cakurire kare mu diwe no ku arumwena diwe dyodikuru ku mengeneno o thsidi no ku thza. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Madiya Magadalena no Madiya yumweya pekarire, o kwa nekara oshungashunga no thsidi.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akwakunyunga thsidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Diyuwa edi dya randire Diyuwa dyOciroithsero,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diyuwa dyOciroithsero po nedi dyo Muthsitanu.</char></note> akuru o mapurisita nAfarithsi a ciwanawanenine kwa Pilatu. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />A ka ambire ci: “Ñathsire wetu, shimbi twa vurukera eyi a ambire oya mukwakwangera o ku yoya yo kuninga ci: ‘Munyima thzo mayuwa ahatu kenge na ku pinduka kwafu.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Mweyo, o tumine ci thsidi thsi nyungiwe nawa shime ku ka kuma mu diyuwa dyo muthsihatu ci erongwa yenthzi katere a ku mwithze no ku tongwera anu ci na pinduka kwafu. Kwangera ko kengeyo kenge kwa kwikara kokumango nene kupita ko kutanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilatu wa ambire ci: “Mashwarare aa ni na mi pa, mu thze mu ka nyunge thsidi momuhe omu mu ka twethsera.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ngou a thzire no ku ka viva diwe dyo ku thsidi no ku ka thsiako akwakunyunga.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CT2, +</para>
  <para style="s1">Kupinduka kwa Yesu kwafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Dyo Savata o ku di na pu, ruura mu diyuwa dyo kutanga mu sunda, a Madiya Magadalena na Madiya yumweya a thzire ku ka thzingura pa thsidi.<figure style="fig" alt="The empty tomb" file="gt00088.tif" size="col" loc="Mat 28:1-7" copy="Gordon" ref="28.1-7">Thsidi thso mukunguru</figure><verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Popo kwekarire kungangama kokukuru ko kaye, inene kangeru ka Fumu ka tundire ku wiru no ku na arumuna diwe ku thsidi no kwikarapo. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Thsihanga thsako thsa monaharire eci kwethsa ko mvura, nevata yako nedi ikenu too. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Akwakunyunga thsidi a yapire nene no ku tutuma, a pwererire no kuara eci ethzimbi.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Unone kangeru ka amberire awo ambuyama ci: “Mwa yapa, inene ni na dimuka ci mwaa fota Yesu oya namba pa mbinda. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Ka a dimo omu! Na pinduka kwafu eci diya a ambire. Mu keye na mu mone paya naa rara. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Mu yokorore mu thze mu ka tongwere erongwa yenthzi ci o na pinduka kwafu, o na citangethza ku nGalileya oku mwaa ka mu monena. Eyi yo ni na keyera ku na mi tongwera.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Awo ambuyama a tundire pa thsidi wanguwangu. A yapire, unone ekarire no thsinyanyu thsothsikuru. A yokororire ku ka tongwera erongwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Popo Yesu wa hokokire kukwo, wa wa vumenenine. Awo a mu henyenine no ku mu kwata kwidyato no ku mu rombera. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yesu ngou a wa amberire ci: “Mwa yapa! Mu thze pohuma, mu ka tongwere aenthzange ci a thze ku nGalileya, kodiyo aa ka ni monena.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muthzimbu wakwakunyunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Awo ambuyama o kwa di mu dikuñwa, amweya kwakwakunyunga thsidi a thzire mu mbongi no ku ka tongwera akuru o mapurisita yoihe eyi ya tendaharire. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Akuru o mapurisita a ciwanine nakuru o mbunga ku ciyongora. Ngou a pire mashwarare madi oangi, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />no ku wa ambera ci: “Mu tongwere anu ci: ‘Erongwa yenthzi shime i na keye othsiku no ku nethza thsithzimbi atwe o ku tu na rara.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Shaanga waa ku i yuve nguvuru, atwe kenge twa ku mu rakwithsa no ku mi tundithsa mukaru ouhe.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Mashwarare a shimbire ao madi no ku tenda eci edi a wa tongwerire. Mweyo, eyi ya yukire mu kaci ko Majuda, karo koku amba a i amba no rerodino.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitumiwa thsoshokuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ete 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Erongwa yo dikumi na thsofoci ngou ya thzire ku nGalileya, ku mukinya ou a wa tongwerire Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ou ya mu monine, ya mu romberire, unone imweya ya mu tamangerire. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu wa henyenine kwirongwa yenthzi no ku i ambera ci: “Na ni piwa okoro ouhe mu wiru no pano pa kaye. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Mweyo, mu thze mu ka rongithse anu o matunga oahe ci ekare erongwa yange. Mwa ku ka wa korovethze mu dithzina dya Tata nedi dya Mwana nedi dyo Mupepo Oukenu. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Mu ka wa rongithse ku hengeka yoihe eyi na ni mi raerera. Mu dimuke ci kenge nikaranga nenu mayuwa oahe shime ku ka kuma ku mamaneneno o kaye.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>